(4304844, 621054, 31637, '<td valign="top">I plan on buying a classic soon, I wouldn''t mind getting one of these. Ford or Chrysler? 6</td>', 'I plan on buying a classic soon, I wouldn''t mind getting one of these. Ford or Chrysler? 6', '2007-12-10 00:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304848, 620838, 31637, '<td valign="top">Great locale and gloss!</td>', 'Great locale and gloss!', '2007-12-10 00:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304849, 621074, 31637, '<td valign="top">Looks like fun !</td>', 'Looks like fun !', '2007-12-10 00:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304854, 620348, 46778, '<td valign="top">Wow, what an unbelievable car... Great shoot and a good technical image. There even appears to be a light inside the car. I''m not particular fond of the sepia conversion. Don''t mess with the Mercedes silver :) I also may have liked the view more from the front - IMHO 7</td>', 'Wow, what an unbelievable car... Great shoot and a good technical image. There even appears to be a light inside the car. I''m not particular fond of the sepia conversion. Don''t mess with the Mercedes silver :) I also may have liked the view more from the front - IMHO 7', '2007-12-10 00:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304858, 620837, 31637, '<td valign="top">Very glossy, nice setup though, very affluent looking.</td>', 'Very glossy, nice setup though, very affluent looking.', '2007-12-10 00:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304868, 620989, 46778, '<td valign="top">I find this image a little flat and you are defiantly not selling me on buying this car :) 5</td>', 'I find this image a little flat and you are defiantly not selling me on buying this car :) 5', '2007-12-10 00:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304881, 620666, 46778, '<td valign="top">Good shoot for begin a model - colors are great. Love the refection. I''m personally look the 1:1 scale cars in the challenge to be a more realistic Automobile Ad IMHO 5</td>', 'Good shoot for begin a model - colors are great. Love the refection. I''m personally look the 1:1 scale cars in the challenge to be a more realistic Automobile Ad IMHO 5', '2007-12-10 00:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304883, 621106, 31637, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, and tough one too. Model must have stood still for a few seconds, looks great!</td>', 'Interesting shot, and tough one too. Model must have stood still for a few seconds, looks great!', '2007-12-10 00:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304890, 621047, 84150, '<td valign="top">Too bad you can see the reflection in the window.</td>', 'Too bad you can see the reflection in the window.', '2007-12-10 00:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304893, 620945, 46778, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting. Also love the snow. A lot of car ad use snow, even if the car have noting to do with snow:) I''m not sure what I do not like, but it misses a little pizzaz for begin a car ad. Maybe it is all of the tire track''s on the road? A good technical shoot IMHO 6</td>', 'Nice lighting. Also love the snow. A lot of car ad use snow, even if the car have noting to do with snow:) I''m not sure what I do not like, but it misses a little pizzaz for begin a car ad. Maybe it is all of the tire track''s on the road? A good technical shoot IMHO 6', '2007-12-10 00:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304904, 620123, 46778, '<td valign="top">Interesting crop. great technical shoot. A believable add for the car 20 years ago. Nice background. I wish the antenna would not be cut by the light. IMHO 7</td>', 'Interesting crop. great technical shoot. A believable add for the car 20 years ago. Nice background. I wish the antenna would not be cut by the light. IMHO 7', '2007-12-10 00:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304919, 620520, 46778, '<td valign="top">Nice car !!! a great concept for a car ad for this automobile and good execution, the only thing I''m not fond of is that the DOF is so shallow that not even all of the "S5" is in focus which seams to be the main point for the shoot. IMHO 6</td>', 'Nice car !!! a great concept for a car ad for this automobile and good execution, the only thing I''m not fond of is that the DOF is so shallow that not even all of the "S5" is in focus which seams to be the main point for the shoot. IMHO 6', '2007-12-10 00:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304925, 620002, 50641, '<td valign="top">Oh  yeah?  What about the tooth fairy?</td>', 'Oh  yeah?  What about the tooth fairy?', '2007-12-10 00:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304934, 620837, 46778, '<td valign="top">Nice car''s. I like that the colors match and it it is a believable shoot to put them in front of 5 star hotel "maybe the Intercontinental?" The only thing that bothers me are that the reflections are so intense that they distract from the cars. IMHO 6</td>', 'Nice car''s. I like that the colors match and it it is a believable shoot to put them in front of 5 star hotel "maybe the Intercontinental?" The only thing that bothers me are that the reflections are so intense that they distract from the cars. IMHO 6', '2007-12-10 00:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304940, 621054, 46778, '<td valign="top">Very nice car shoot. Tight crop with lot''s of sharp detail. Only under the "S" can I see you :) -7-</td>', 'Very nice car shoot. Tight crop with lot''s of sharp detail. Only under the "S" can I see you :) -7-', '2007-12-10 00:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304947, 621067, 46778, '<td valign="top">Nice car shoot. Good rule of thirds. I like the angle and composition. Nothing that you can do about, but the silver blends a little to well with the sky. IMHO -6-</td>', 'Nice car shoot. Good rule of thirds. I like the angle and composition. Nothing that you can do about, but the silver blends a little to well with the sky. IMHO -6-', '2007-12-10 00:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304954, 620785, 46778, '<td valign="top">The viper... Nice DOF. Technically a good shoot. I would like to see the 1:1 scale car''s in this challenge. IMHO -5-</td>', 'The viper... Nice DOF. Technically a good shoot. I would like to see the 1:1 scale car''s in this challenge. IMHO -5-', '2007-12-10 00:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304964, 621051, 46778, '<td valign="top">A lot of work went into this shoot... Great colors and a very believable looking car ad. The onl thing that I would have changed is a closer or different crop. IMHO -7-</td>', 'A lot of work went into this shoot... Great colors and a very believable looking car ad. The onl thing that I would have changed is a closer or different crop. IMHO -7-', '2007-12-10 00:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304969, 620539, 46778, '<td valign="top">I like the B&amp;W conversion to go along with a vintage car. I also like the close crop. Not sure about the snow and slightly soft focus. IMHO -6-</td>', 'I like the B&W conversion to go along with a vintage car. I also like the close crop. Not sure about the snow and slightly soft focus. IMHO -6-', '2007-12-10 00:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304980, 621125, 46778, '<td valign="top">A fresh angle to the challenge. The extra interior light is interesting and highlights the brand logo, but it also darkens the passenger side and I almost would like to see a more balance between the two. IMHO -7-</td>', 'A fresh angle to the challenge. The extra interior light is interesting and highlights the brand logo, but it also darkens the passenger side and I almost would like to see a more balance between the two. IMHO -7-', '2007-12-10 00:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304984, 619771, 46778, '<td valign="top">Almost a high key shot. It goes well with the B&amp;W look. -6-</td>', 'Almost a high key shot. It goes well with the B&W look. -6-', '2007-12-10 01:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304989, 620946, 46778, '<td valign="top">Good composition. Rule of thirds and leading lines. Either the reflections, or the lighting, or color de saturations make the car look less appealing than it is. IMHO -6-</td>', 'Good composition. Rule of thirds and leading lines. Either the reflections, or the lighting, or color de saturations make the car look less appealing than it is. IMHO -6-', '2007-12-10 01:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305002, 620041, 46778, '<td valign="top">Nice car. Great B&amp;W conversion and interesting angle for a technically good shoot. The only nit pick I have is that the car looks like it just has been parked while it snowed. Given your title I would like to see some more evidence of that defiance. IMHO -6-</td>', 'Nice car. Great B&W conversion and interesting angle for a technically good shoot. The only nit pick I have is that the car looks like it just has been parked while it snowed. Given your title I would like to see some more evidence of that defiance. IMHO -6-', '2007-12-10 01:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305006, 620908, 46778, '<td valign="top">Great composition of a very believable ad. -9-</td>', 'Great composition of a very believable ad. -9-', '2007-12-10 01:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305008, 620921, 46778, '<td valign="top">Good technical shoot. Not selling me on a particular car, but more an a brand. -5-</td>', 'Good technical shoot. Not selling me on a particular car, but more an a brand. -5-', '2007-12-10 01:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305010, 621094, 46778, '<td valign="top">Nice post processing. Good shoot for a car ad. -7-</td>', 'Nice post processing. Good shoot for a car ad. -7-', '2007-12-10 01:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
