(4305081, 620831, 46778, '<td valign="top">Very nice car ad shoot. Love the B&amp;W colors as well as the low cloud sky. I just wish that the flash reflection would not be so predominant in the front next to the turn signal. Should do well in this challenge. -7-</td>', 'Very nice car ad shoot. Love the B&W colors as well as the low cloud sky. I just wish that the flash reflection would not be so predominant in the front next to the turn signal. Should do well in this challenge. -7-', '2007-12-10 01:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305086, 620002, 46778, '<td valign="top">Are you selling the jeep or the kid, or is it a package deal?  Technically a very well executed shoot. The setup is good and the lighting is great. I''m looking for more of the 1:1 scale car ad''s in this challenge. IMHO -6-</td>', 'Are you selling the jeep or the kid, or is it a package deal?  Technically a very well executed shoot. The setup is good and the lighting is great. I''m looking for more of the 1:1 scale car ad''s in this challenge. IMHO -6-', '2007-12-10 01:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
