(4305109, 620744, 46778, '<td valign="top">Good B&amp;W conversion. Interesting interpretation of the challenge. A believable ad for GMC, I would like to see a little bit more of the truck for it to be a promotion of a particular vehicle. IMHO -6-</td>', 'Good B&W conversion. Interesting interpretation of the challenge. A believable ad for GMC, I would like to see a little bit more of the truck for it to be a promotion of a particular vehicle. IMHO -6-', '2007-12-10 02:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
