(4305337, 620002, 39430, '<td valign="top">Hello!  Well, timfy, if this is yours, I don''t know why it''s heading for brown ribbon territory.  If this is Aimee, well done, and you''ll probably beat Timfy this week.  :)  I like the idea, and it''s pretty well done, as we can expect from you guys.  The editing on the background is a little messy, and the burning on Aidan''s jumper is a bit patchy.  But, probably the fact that this is not a real car might hurt this one in the voting.  (Don''t tell him I said it''s not real.  That''s an argument I don''t want to start.)</td>', 'Hello!  Well, timfy, if this is yours, I don''t know why it''s heading for brown ribbon territory.  If this is Aimee, well done, and you''ll probably beat Timfy this week.  :)  I like the idea, and it''s pretty well done, as we can expect from you guys.  The editing on the background is a little messy, and the burning on Aidan''s jumper is a bit patchy.  But, probably the fact that this is not a real car might hurt this one in the voting.  (Don''t tell him I said it''s not real.  That''s an argument I don''t want to start.)', '2007-12-10 04:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305338, 620917, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice background, but the car doesn''t really jump out of this picture.  Maybe get closer.</td>', 'Nice background, but the car doesn''t really jump out of this picture.  Maybe get closer.', '2007-12-10 04:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305339, 621125, 39430, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit dark, and we can''t actually see much of the car.  :(</td>', 'It''s a bit dark, and we can''t actually see much of the car.  :(', '2007-12-10 04:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305341, 620931, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and angles, but the dirt and scraggly tree don''t help much, so I''d crop them off.</td>', 'Nice colours and angles, but the dirt and scraggly tree don''t help much, so I''d crop them off.', '2007-12-10 04:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
