(4305348, 620979, 39430, '<td valign="top">Not quite centred enough to be centred, and not quite off-centre enough to be off-centred.  Not enough drops to be a nice water beading shot, but not clean and dry enough to be smooth.  So, decide what you are going for, and with some pretty minor changes, this could be a pretty good shot.</td>', 'Not quite centred enough to be centred, and not quite off-centre enough to be off-centred.  Not enough drops to be a nice water beading shot, but not clean and dry enough to be smooth.  So, decide what you are going for, and with some pretty minor changes, this could be a pretty good shot.', '2007-12-10 05:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
