(4305375, 620283, 49109, '<td valign="top">the tilt is a bit strong, the crop is a bit unfortunate. good color and sharpness</td>', 'the tilt is a bit strong, the crop is a bit unfortunate. good color and sharpness', '2007-12-10 05:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305378, 621067, 39430, '<td valign="top">I''d go for less sky, and more snow.</td>', 'I''d go for less sky, and more snow.', '2007-12-10 05:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305379, 621047, 39430, '<td valign="top">The reflection is the most annoying thing here.  Also would be better with a slightly wider crop.</td>', 'The reflection is the most annoying thing here.  Also would be better with a slightly wider crop.', '2007-12-10 05:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305380, 620823, 49109, '<td valign="top">not too impressing, lighting is too flat</td>', 'not too impressing, lighting is too flat', '2007-12-10 05:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305381, 620861, 49109, '<td valign="top">no clear focus, oversaturated</td>', 'no clear focus, oversaturated', '2007-12-10 05:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305382, 620520, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice sparkles, although it''s a pity the logo is not a bit clearer.</td>', 'Nice sparkles, although it''s a pity the logo is not a bit clearer.', '2007-12-10 05:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305383, 620666, 49109, '<td valign="top">good product shot</td>', 'good product shot', '2007-12-10 05:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305384, 620202, 39430, '<td valign="top">Sold!  Now, anyone want to buy the car off me?  This shot is pretty noisy in the trees, and a little oversaturated.</td>', 'Sold!  Now, anyone want to buy the car off me?  This shot is pretty noisy in the trees, and a little oversaturated.', '2007-12-10 05:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305385, 621054, 39430, '<td valign="top">This must a beautiful car.  Would be good to see more of it!</td>', 'This must a beautiful car.  Would be good to see more of it!', '2007-12-10 05:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305388, 620539, 86849, '<td valign="top">nice christmassy shot</td>', 'nice christmassy shot', '2007-12-10 05:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305389, 620041, 39430, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this shot really has the right tones to work well as a BW.  Maybe a partial desat would work better.  There''s a lot of clutter her with the snow and the leaves that detracts.</td>', 'I don''t think this shot really has the right tones to work well as a BW.  Maybe a partial desat would work better.  There''s a lot of clutter her with the snow and the leaves that detracts.', '2007-12-10 05:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305394, 620861, 39430, '<td valign="top">What is that stuff?  For me, it just messes up the image, although it does add a little colour with the blues and greens.</td>', 'What is that stuff?  For me, it just messes up the image, although it does add a little colour with the blues and greens.', '2007-12-10 05:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305395, 621002, 39430, '<td valign="top">What''s that reflection in the bonnet?  Looks like a pair of pants on a washing line.  :)  The woodland setting is a great idea, but a clearing would have given smoother reflections on the car.</td>', 'What''s that reflection in the bonnet?  Looks like a pair of pants on a washing line.  :)  The woodland setting is a great idea, but a clearing would have given smoother reflections on the car.', '2007-12-10 05:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305397, 620889, 86849, '<td valign="top">nice shot. I like the choice of B&amp;W here, plays well with silver car. I would say the sky is slightly too dark on the top of the pic...(MO) but I like it.</td>', 'nice shot. I like the choice of B&W here, plays well with silver car. I would say the sky is slightly too dark on the top of the pic...(MO) but I like it.', '2007-12-10 05:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305398, 620889, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice BW, and cool sky.  The buildings are a little distracting, so I would either try to hide them somehow, or crop them off.  The hotspot on the car should be toned down in editing, and maybe bring up the brand logo, so it stands out more.</td>', 'Nice BW, and cool sky.  The buildings are a little distracting, so I would either try to hide them somehow, or crop them off.  The hotspot on the car should be toned down in editing, and maybe bring up the brand logo, so it stands out more.', '2007-12-10 05:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305399, 620908, 86849, '<td valign="top">Great studio shot. The steering wheel asks for more focus (IMO) but all in all good composition and unusuall perspective</td>', 'Great studio shot. The steering wheel asks for more focus (IMO) but all in all good composition and unusuall perspective', '2007-12-10 05:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305400, 620881, 39430, '<td valign="top">The cross-processing or colour toning works really well here.  It''s a touch high contrast for my liking, and I''d prefer to see the car a little bigger in the frame, but overall, a really nice image.</td>', 'The cross-processing or colour toning works really well here.  It''s a touch high contrast for my liking, and I''d prefer to see the car a little bigger in the frame, but overall, a really nice image.', '2007-12-10 05:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305402, 621077, 86849, '<td valign="top">nice shot and i like the choice of old fashioned shot, to compliment the car. And people somehow look like they all want the car ..hehe. Maybe a wide angle, or lower crop would do better? It looks like there is too much empty space above the people (IMO)</td>', 'nice shot and i like the choice of old fashioned shot, to compliment the car. And people somehow look like they all want the car ..hehe. Maybe a wide angle, or lower crop would do better? It looks like there is too much empty space above the people (IMO)', '2007-12-10 05:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305405, 620683, 39430, '<td valign="top">Having 2 cars in the frame here is very distracting, and the large expanse of bonnet doesn''t work for me.  Maybe a lower viewpoint, focussing more on the Benz logo would work well.  The red ribbon is a nice addition.</td>', 'Having 2 cars in the frame here is very distracting, and the large expanse of bonnet doesn''t work for me.  Maybe a lower viewpoint, focussing more on the Benz logo would work well.  The red ribbon is a nice addition.', '2007-12-10 05:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305406, 620861, 86849, '<td valign="top">nice "light rain" effect here. Looks like a play car to me...or is it real?</td>', 'nice "light rain" effect here. Looks like a play car to me...or is it real?', '2007-12-10 05:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305407, 621092, 86849, '<td valign="top">Nice and shiny, just the way car should be</td>', 'Nice and shiny, just the way car should be', '2007-12-10 05:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305409, 621069, 39430, '<td valign="top">Very nice sky and dramatic angle.  Pity we can''t see more of the car - it''s really hard even tell what sort of car it is.</td>', 'Very nice sky and dramatic angle.  Pity we can''t see more of the car - it''s really hard even tell what sort of car it is.', '2007-12-10 05:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305412, 621074, 39430, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.  It''s a pity the subject is blown out.  Fix the exposure, do some editing on the background, crop a little off the bottom, and this would be great.  Nice leading lines.</td>', 'Cool shot.  It''s a pity the subject is blown out.  Fix the exposure, do some editing on the background, crop a little off the bottom, and this would be great.  Nice leading lines.', '2007-12-10 05:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305418, 619771, 86849, '<td valign="top">cool car and interesting exposure, i like how the half is pure white when other half has showroom floor+doors</td>', 'cool car and interesting exposure, i like how the half is pure white when other half has showroom floor+doors', '2007-12-10 05:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305420, 620538, 39430, '<td valign="top">This has a lot of potential.  It''s a beautiful old car, with superb curvy lines.  You''ve done a great job to get smooth reflections without distractions, and nice subtle editing.  It''s a true pity it is so small.</td>', 'This has a lot of potential.  It''s a beautiful old car, with superb curvy lines.  You''ve done a great job to get smooth reflections without distractions, and nice subtle editing.  It''s a true pity it is so small.', '2007-12-10 05:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305425, 621048, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection!  This sort of blurred DOF is difficult to do well, so really think carefully about whether you need it, and try to achieve it in the original shot, rather than processing.  It will look much better.</td>', 'Nice reflection!  This sort of blurred DOF is difficult to do well, so really think carefully about whether you need it, and try to achieve it in the original shot, rather than processing.  It will look much better.', '2007-12-10 05:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305428, 620977, 39430, '<td valign="top">Very effective lighting!  There''s a distracting tree reflection in the upper highlight.</td>', 'Very effective lighting!  There''s a distracting tree reflection in the upper highlight.', '2007-12-10 05:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305429, 621091, 39430, '<td valign="top">Well, at least it''s honest.  :)  The blown highlights are not ideal.</td>', 'Well, at least it''s honest.  :)  The blown highlights are not ideal.', '2007-12-10 05:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305430, 620921, 39430, '<td valign="top">Cool atmosphere.  Apart from the sign, everything is a little dark though.  I would be good to see more light on the wall, and a more striking curves for the car.</td>', 'Cool atmosphere.  Apart from the sign, everything is a little dark though.  I would be good to see more light on the wall, and a more striking curves for the car.', '2007-12-10 05:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305432, 621008, 39430, '<td valign="top">The sky isn''t that interesting, so I''d like to see less of it, and more car or road.  You probably went for the desat on purpose for an old-time feel, but this is such a beautiful car, I think a little more colour would probably be a good thing.</td>', 'The sky isn''t that interesting, so I''d like to see less of it, and more car or road.  You probably went for the desat on purpose for an old-time feel, but this is such a beautiful car, I think a little more colour would probably be a good thing.', '2007-12-10 05:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305433, 620348, 86849, '<td valign="top">nice ride. The barrier in foreground spoils a look a bit (IMO)</td>', 'nice ride. The barrier in foreground spoils a look a bit (IMO)', '2007-12-10 05:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305439, 620837, 39430, '<td valign="top">The most distracting thing here is the reflections.  The cars are so clean and shiny, you almost don''t see the cars, just the busy reflections.  A polariser could really help here, or maybe just a different standpoint.  I like the slogan.  Is that their''s or yours?</td>', 'The most distracting thing here is the reflections.  The cars are so clean and shiny, you almost don''t see the cars, just the busy reflections.  A polariser could really help here, or maybe just a different standpoint.  I like the slogan.  Is that their''s or yours?', '2007-12-10 05:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305440, 621094, 86849, '<td valign="top">interesting shot</td>', 'interesting shot', '2007-12-10 05:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305441, 621081, 86849, '<td valign="top">great angle, good choice of background for this car</td>', 'great angle, good choice of background for this car', '2007-12-10 05:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305442, 620348, 39430, '<td valign="top">Pity about that guardrail.  Apart from that, this is a nice ''period photo'' of the car.</td>', 'Pity about that guardrail.  Apart from that, this is a nice ''period photo'' of the car.', '2007-12-10 05:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305444, 620283, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice editing.  You''ve brought out the colours really nicely.  I would crop a little of the left side of this shot.</td>', 'Nice editing.  You''ve brought out the colours really nicely.  I would crop a little of the left side of this shot.', '2007-12-10 05:59:03.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4305445, 621091, 86849, '<td valign="top">nice closeup, but I would like to see more of the car (I am not paying 100 bucks for a light only ;) )</td>', 'nice closeup, but I would like to see more of the car (I am not paying 100 bucks for a light only ;) )', '2007-12-10 05:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305446, 620539, 39430, '<td valign="top">These tones work very well as a BW.</td>', 'These tones work very well as a BW.', '2007-12-10 06:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305447, 620677, 86849, '<td valign="top">haha, where can I buy it?</td>', 'haha, where can I buy it?', '2007-12-10 06:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305451, 620925, 39430, '<td valign="top">This would be better without the water drops on the paintwork.  Mabye one on the paws could stay.  Nice lines.</td>', 'This would be better without the water drops on the paintwork.  Mabye one on the paws could stay.  Nice lines.', '2007-12-10 06:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305452, 620823, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice clean image and grey tones.  A little editing might be good to bring out some of the details just a touch more.</td>', 'Nice clean image and grey tones.  A little editing might be good to bring out some of the details just a touch more.', '2007-12-10 06:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305453, 621051, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp panning shot, and great colours.  I''d like to see the car bigger in the frame, so ride your bike a little closer to the front wheel for the next shot.  :)</td>', 'Nice crisp panning shot, and great colours.  I''d like to see the car bigger in the frame, so ride your bike a little closer to the front wheel for the next shot.  :)', '2007-12-10 06:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305455, 621128, 39430, '<td valign="top">This ends up a bit too abstract for my taste.  :(</td>', 'This ends up a bit too abstract for my taste.  :(', '2007-12-10 06:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305457, 620618, 55956, '<td valign="top">eheheh the title is taken by the windows95 spot?</td>', 'eheheh the title is taken by the windows95 spot?', '2007-12-10 06:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305458, 620618, 39430, '<td valign="top">GREAT location!  I would suggest either somehow lighting the back of the car, or just cropping it off.  There''s also some haloing on the edge of the grass which is distracting.  But still, this is an amazing shot..</td>', 'GREAT location!  I would suggest either somehow lighting the back of the car, or just cropping it off.  There''s also some haloing on the edge of the grass which is distracting.  But still, this is an amazing shot..', '2007-12-10 06:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305459, 620946, 39430, '<td valign="top">The exposure needs some work here.  Oh, and so does that road.  :)</td>', 'The exposure needs some work here.  Oh, and so does that road.  :)', '2007-12-10 06:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305460, 621106, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice wide lens.  I like the person in the car.  Not many shots in this challenge show anyone in the car, so it''s good to see it here, and it works well.  He just looks right for that car.</td>', 'Nice wide lens.  I like the person in the car.  Not many shots in this challenge show anyone in the car, so it''s good to see it here, and it works well.  He just looks right for that car.', '2007-12-10 06:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305463, 620704, 39430, '<td valign="top">There''s just too much light off the back of the car, and the reflection of the sky is too bright.  I love the car though.  I had to sell my RX7 5 years ago and move on to a family car.  :(</td>', 'There''s just too much light off the back of the car, and the reflection of the sky is too bright.  I love the car though.  I had to sell my RX7 5 years ago and move on to a family car.  :(', '2007-12-10 06:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305469, 620908, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp contrasts and simple colours.  Would make a great car poster.</td>', 'Nice crisp contrasts and simple colours.  Would make a great car poster.', '2007-12-10 06:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305473, 619771, 39430, '<td valign="top">A bit over-contrasty for my liking.</td>', 'A bit over-contrasty for my liking.', '2007-12-10 06:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305475, 621087, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice mixing of the 2 scenes.  The shadow at the front of the car is not idea.</td>', 'Nice mixing of the 2 scenes.  The shadow at the front of the car is not idea.', '2007-12-10 06:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305478, 620123, 39430, '<td valign="top">I was expecting more HDR editing in this challenge.  Nice to see one!  The levels are not perfect with the blown sky, and the blacks could be blacker, but I love the smooth lines that this editing gives.  I wish I could do it.  Feel free to let me know whether you used a plugin, or did it manually.</td>', 'I was expecting more HDR editing in this challenge.  Nice to see one!  The levels are not perfect with the blown sky, and the blacks could be blacker, but I love the smooth lines that this editing gives.  I wish I could do it.  Feel free to let me know whether you used a plugin, or did it manually.', '2007-12-10 06:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305479, 621069, 66353, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective - but it doesn''t tell me anything about which car I''m looking at, and I doubt it will sell any cars because of that.</td>', 'I like the perspective - but it doesn''t tell me anything about which car I''m looking at, and I doubt it will sell any cars because of that.', '2007-12-10 06:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305482, 621010, 66353, '<td valign="top">I doubt this will sell any cars</td>', 'I doubt this will sell any cars', '2007-12-10 06:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305483, 620744, 39430, '<td valign="top">Funny.  :)  They aren''t quite looking at the car though, so it took me a while to work it out.  Nice different take for the challenge.</td>', 'Funny.  :)  They aren''t quite looking at the car though, so it took me a while to work it out.  Nice different take for the challenge.', '2007-12-10 06:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305488, 620785, 39430, '<td valign="top">The DOF is a bit too thin here.  I''d close it up at least one stop for a shallow DOF, or 2-3 stops to get it all in focus.</td>', 'The DOF is a bit too thin here.  I''d close it up at least one stop for a shallow DOF, or 2-3 stops to get it all in focus.', '2007-12-10 06:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305490, 620868, 39430, '<td valign="top">I like the title, but I don''t like the editing here.</td>', 'I like the title, but I don''t like the editing here.', '2007-12-10 06:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305494, 620754, 39430, '<td valign="top">Hey, how did you take this?  It would be better done on a non-rainy day for nicer reflections on the car.</td>', 'Hey, how did you take this?  It would be better done on a non-rainy day for nicer reflections on the car.', '2007-12-10 06:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305497, 620282, 39430, '<td valign="top">There''s something fuzzy about the front corners of the car.  The subdued colours with the Gold are really cool, but they need something to make them really work.  I can''t put my finger on what it is.  Maybe this is one of those images that needs the right frame to really work well.</td>', 'There''s something fuzzy about the front corners of the car.  The subdued colours with the Gold are really cool, but they need something to make them really work.  I can''t put my finger on what it is.  Maybe this is one of those images that needs the right frame to really work well.', '2007-12-10 06:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305501, 621010, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice spooky photo, but it doesn''t really seem to be about the car.  :(</td>', 'Nice spooky photo, but it doesn''t really seem to be about the car.  :(', '2007-12-10 06:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305520, 620931, 86849, '<td valign="top">good DOF and i like the way car and sky angle up into perspecive together. Nice work on sky and great light on the car. Balanced photo</td>', 'good DOF and i like the way car and sky angle up into perspecive together. Nice work on sky and great light on the car. Balanced photo', '2007-12-10 06:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305522, 620002, 86849, '<td valign="top">haha, nice one. I like his expression. That car must be fast!</td>', 'haha, nice one. I like his expression. That car must be fast!', '2007-12-10 06:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305524, 620282, 86849, '<td valign="top">I like that it has lights on, and the fact that bckgrnd is blurred, puts the car up front</td>', 'I like that it has lights on, and the fact that bckgrnd is blurred, puts the car up front', '2007-12-10 06:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305526, 620041, 86849, '<td valign="top">really nice. Angle, frost, B&amp;W and the surround.. i think i like everything in the shot. Maybe car could be just a wee bit more shiny(IMO)</td>', 'really nice. Angle, frost, B&W and the surround.. i think i like everything in the shot. Maybe car could be just a wee bit more shiny(IMO)', '2007-12-10 06:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305528, 620666, 86849, '<td valign="top">nice ittle car. I like the reflection</td>', 'nice ittle car. I like the reflection', '2007-12-10 06:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305533, 620977, 86849, '<td valign="top">nice lihting, looks like car is just driving out of the warehouse and is having its first riide</td>', 'nice lihting, looks like car is just driving out of the warehouse and is having its first riide', '2007-12-10 06:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305534, 621106, 42171, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of an absolute american classic - Would love one of these one day! (Not too common in the UK though!)</td>', 'Nice shot of an absolute american classic - Would love one of these one day! (Not too common in the UK though!)', '2007-12-10 06:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305535, 620683, 86849, '<td valign="top">nice shot, but somehow the bow pops out too much, maybe a bit laee saturation? (IMO)</td>', 'nice shot, but somehow the bow pops out too much, maybe a bit laee saturation? (IMO)', '2007-12-10 06:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305536, 620831, 86849, '<td valign="top">really cool. I like the frosty / foggy morning bckgrnd</td>', 'really cool. I like the frosty / foggy morning bckgrnd', '2007-12-10 06:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305537, 621051, 86849, '<td valign="top">nice motion capture</td>', 'nice motion capture', '2007-12-10 06:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305539, 621048, 86849, '<td valign="top">unreal reflection! nice one</td>', 'unreal reflection! nice one', '2007-12-10 07:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305541, 621125, 86849, '<td valign="top">cool motion shot, slightly too dark (IMO)</td>', 'cool motion shot, slightly too dark (IMO)', '2007-12-10 07:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305542, 621027, 86849, '<td valign="top">nice unusual shot, but where is the car? when its coming out? hehe</td>', 'nice unusual shot, but where is the car? when its coming out? hehe', '2007-12-10 07:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305544, 621002, 86849, '<td valign="top">nice shot. Shows the abbilities of the car</td>', 'nice shot. Shows the abbilities of the car', '2007-12-10 07:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305547, 621074, 86849, '<td valign="top">really nice action shot. Bit too much of a space on the upper part of image (IMO)</td>', 'really nice action shot. Bit too much of a space on the upper part of image (IMO)', '2007-12-10 07:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305548, 620618, 86849, '<td valign="top">impressed, love the shadows and the infinity of the shot!</td>', 'impressed, love the shadows and the infinity of the shot!', '2007-12-10 07:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305550, 621009, 63398, '<td valign="top">Great relation of image to title.....great choice of DOF. Well done! 8</td>', 'Great relation of image to title.....great choice of DOF. Well done! 8', '2007-12-10 07:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305551, 620831, 42171, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - Should do well.</td>', 'Nice shot - Should do well.', '2007-12-10 07:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305556, 621092, 63398, '<td valign="top">Nice image, but it just doesn''t really inspire me to rush out and buy a Ford.</td>', 'Nice image, but it just doesn''t really inspire me to rush out and buy a Ford.', '2007-12-10 07:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305557, 621081, 63398, '<td valign="top">Great composition! Location, location, location!!! LOL!!! Well Done!!! 8</td>', 'Great composition! Location, location, location!!! LOL!!! Well Done!!! 8', '2007-12-10 07:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305558, 620520, 86849, '<td valign="top">unusuall focus point. Nice shot</td>', 'unusuall focus point. Nice shot', '2007-12-10 07:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305559, 621105, 86849, '<td valign="top">good shot, I would like to see more light and shine on the alloys</td>', 'good shot, I would like to see more light and shine on the alloys', '2007-12-10 07:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305560, 620282, 63398, '<td valign="top">I should apologize in advance......gold cars don''t work for advertising, they''re too neutral, the title doesn''t really tie in to the image, the setting is kind of depressing and barren looking......doesn''t help sell the car IMO.....the skewed perspective is good, the lights on are good, the exposure is good....with a different color car, it may have carried the background, but also, with the word power in the title, sitting still doesn''t help convey that image. HTH, anyway....</td>', 'I should apologize in advance......gold cars don''t work for advertising, they''re too neutral, the title doesn''t really tie in to the image, the setting is kind of depressing and barren looking......doesn''t help sell the car IMO.....the skewed perspective is good, the lights on are good, the exposure is good....with a different color car, it may have carried the background, but also, with the word power in the title, sitting still doesn''t help convey that image. HTH, anyway....', '2007-12-10 07:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
