(4305751, 620348, 63398, '<td valign="top">Whoa! How''d you get your hands on a Gullwing????? 9 for rarity!!! Oh, great image too, though the guard rail sucks and is what kept me from giving this a 10. Nice lighting and processing.</td>', 'Whoa! How''d you get your hands on a Gullwing????? 9 for rarity!!! Oh, great image too, though the guard rail sucks and is what kept me from giving this a 10. Nice lighting and processing.', '2007-12-10 08:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305752, 620282, 81382, '<td valign="top">Missing number plate really makes this look like something out of a magazine and makes all the difference. Lovely glow around the lights, the composition works well with the viewpoint angle although you have quite a bit of wasted space towards the top. Might have been better to do landscape with just the car filling the frame but still keeping the angle. Nice DOF and good focus on the lights of the car, the lights are essentially the eyes and so portrait photography rules apply.</td>', 'Missing number plate really makes this look like something out of a magazine and makes all the difference. Lovely glow around the lights, the composition works well with the viewpoint angle although you have quite a bit of wasted space towards the top. Might have been better to do landscape with just the car filling the frame but still keeping the angle. Nice DOF and good focus on the lights of the car, the lights are essentially the eyes and so portrait photography rules apply.', '2007-12-10 08:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305755, 620568, 3102, '<td valign="top">Was it driving through the scene of a nuclear accident?</td>', 'Was it driving through the scene of a nuclear accident?', '2007-12-10 08:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305765, 621069, 63398, '<td valign="top">Good composition. I like the angle and perspective. Great setting.</td>', 'Good composition. I like the angle and perspective. Great setting.', '2007-12-10 08:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305768, 620704, 81382, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the border nor the the angle. When reading up on car photography before doing the challenge myself, the recommendation was to avoid shooting from eye level and aim to go for about wheel height with a wide angle lens. This seems higher than eye level and I''m not sure it works all that well. The cropping is very tight and you have quite a distracting background. Quite a lot of glare from the roof too.</td>', 'Not sure about the border nor the the angle. When reading up on car photography before doing the challenge myself, the recommendation was to avoid shooting from eye level and aim to go for about wheel height with a wide angle lens. This seems higher than eye level and I''m not sure it works all that well. The cropping is very tight and you have quite a distracting background. Quite a lot of glare from the roof too.', '2007-12-10 08:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305770, 620002, 63398, '<td valign="top">LOL!!! Cute!!! Nicely composed.</td>', 'LOL!!! Cute!!! Nicely composed.', '2007-12-10 08:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305775, 620283, 63398, '<td valign="top">Good composition, but the perspective is too askew for my tastes. I''m not sure I buy the title, either. Haunting, sobering, evocative image.</td>', 'Good composition, but the perspective is too askew for my tastes. I''m not sure I buy the title, either. Haunting, sobering, evocative image.', '2007-12-10 08:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
