(4305784, 620868, 81382, '<td valign="top">You see to have a bit of camera shake or motion blur here which unfortunately is the first thing hit me, secondly was the colour scheme - all the cars look the same colour and seem to blend in with all surfaces of the location. I would normally expected to see a single clean car in an advert, rather than many cropped/obscured ones.</td>', 'You see to have a bit of camera shake or motion blur here which unfortunately is the first thing hit me, secondly was the colour scheme - all the cars look the same colour and seem to blend in with all surfaces of the location. I would normally expected to see a single clean car in an advert, rather than many cropped/obscured ones.', '2007-12-10 08:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4305786, 620838, 63398, '<td valign="top">Isn''t it "The RELENTLESS pursuit of perfection."? LOL!!! The crop is a little too tight on an otherwise terrific image. I like the softened edges/border a lot.</td>', 'Isn''t it "The RELENTLESS pursuit of perfection."? LOL!!! The crop is a little too tight on an otherwise terrific image. I like the softened edges/border a lot.', '2007-12-10 08:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
