(4305797, 620754, 63398, '<td valign="top">It''d be tougher if it was an F250/350! LOL!!! I think it would have been a little more imposing with the rest of the front of the truck in the image. Just my $0.02 US</td>', 'It''d be tougher if it was an F250/350! LOL!!! I think it would have been a little more imposing with the rest of the front of the truck in the image. Just my $0.02 US', '2007-12-10 09:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
