(4305933, 620041, 63398, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. I can think of nothing I would do to make this better. I like it on multip[le levels and I think your choices were spot on across the board. 9</td>', 'Nicely done. I can think of nothing I would do to make this better. I like it on multip[le levels and I think your choices were spot on across the board. 9', '2007-12-10 10:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
