(4305966, 620837, 73235, '<td valign="top">nice set up for these cars.the high contrast between the dark paint and the brighter background works well. There are 3 things that distract me: the woman on the left and the slight OOF on the car in the background (a longer shutterspeed could have made the woman invisible and in crease the DOF). the 3rd part are the strong reflections on the hood and wind shield (no idea how to avoid them)</td>', 'nice set up for these cars.the high contrast between the dark paint and the brighter background works well. There are 3 things that distract me: the woman on the left and the slight OOF on the car in the background (a longer shutterspeed could have made the woman invisible and in crease the DOF). the 3rd part are the strong reflections on the hood and wind shield (no idea how to avoid them)', '2007-12-10 10:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
