(4306315, 621069, 68586, '<td valign="top">great sky and interesting p.o.v. - I''m not sure the car is captivating enough though - I think a strong red or yellow colour to the car would have really added punch to this shot.</td>', 'great sky and interesting p.o.v. - I''m not sure the car is captivating enough though - I think a strong red or yellow colour to the car would have really added punch to this shot.', '2007-12-10 13:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4306318, 621067, 68586, '<td valign="top">Nice clear shot, a little lacking in colour for me though, between the white snow, silver car and light blue sky, it all just lacks a little punch.</td>', 'Nice clear shot, a little lacking in colour for me though, between the white snow, silver car and light blue sky, it all just lacks a little punch.', '2007-12-10 13:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4306327, 620002, 68586, '<td valign="top">Yay - a star in a car  :-  )<br/> <br/>Great scowl . . the facial expression (and car) fit the title perfectly.</td>', 'Yay - a star in a car  :-  ) Great scowl . . the facial expression (and car) fit the title perfectly.', '2007-12-10 13:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4306339, 620744, 68586, '<td valign="top">Love the idea of this and the title, but the crowd appear to be staring behind the car rather than at it.<br/> <br/>Well spotted though and a really good concept.</td>', 'Love the idea of this and the title, but the crowd appear to be staring behind the car rather than at it. Well spotted though and a really good concept.', '2007-12-10 13:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4306349, 620837, 68586, '<td valign="top">Posh forecourt.<br/> <br/>This coud be enhanced for me by losing the reflection from the windscreen and having the lady (exiting the picture at the back) actually by the cars, or even better maybe a bit of movement blur as people walk around these and look at them.</td>', 'Posh forecourt. This coud be enhanced for me by losing the reflection from the windscreen and having the lady (exiting the picture at the back) actually by the cars, or even better maybe a bit of movement blur as people walk around these and look at them.', '2007-12-10 13:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
