(4306418, 620002, 73235, '<td valign="top">tough cookie, good facial expression. great lighting</td>', 'tough cookie, good facial expression. great lighting', '2007-12-10 13:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4306439, 620881, 87123, '<td valign="top">I''d be just a little worried with the top still down.</td>', 'I''d be just a little worried with the top still down.', '2007-12-10 14:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4306457, 621051, 68035, '<td valign="top">Best in challenge from my opinion.  You see this picture and you think ''mmm I''d like one of those'' super composition colouring and the foreground motion blurring works very well.  9 from me (the only thing stopping it from being a 10 is that I would like the car to be a tad larger in the frame)<br/> <br/>Great photo, good luck</td>', 'Best in challenge from my opinion.  You see this picture and you think ''mmm I''d like one of those'' super composition colouring and the foreground motion blurring works very well.  9 from me (the only thing stopping it from being a 10 is that I would like the car to be a tad larger in the frame) Great photo, good luck', '2007-12-10 14:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4306459, 620889, 68035, '<td valign="top">Super photo (so good in fact in terms of ''selling'' the car that it made me go onto a website and see how much these cost...sadly I live in the UK and we apparently dont sell Camry''s here)<br/> <br/>Like the B&amp;W conversion, though possibly the contrast levels could have been tweaked a touch<br/> <br/>Super image that meets the challenge very well - 8</td>', 'Super photo (so good in fact in terms of ''selling'' the car that it made me go onto a website and see how much these cost...sadly I live in the UK and we apparently dont sell Camry''s here) Like the B&W conversion, though possibly the contrast levels could have been tweaked a touch Super image that meets the challenge very well - 8', '2007-12-10 14:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4306460, 620881, 68035, '<td valign="top">Does this image make me want to but a 366?  Possibly not, but it did stop me in my tracks.  Super colours and a great job on the clouds (Gosh I hope the skies did not open given that the roof was down.<br/> <br/>Nice S bend and diagonal leading line although I may have liked it even more if you had played with the straightening tool to give the effect of the car going up, rather than down hill.  Even as it is a very nice shot 8</td>', 'Does this image make me want to but a 366?  Possibly not, but it did stop me in my tracks.  Super colours and a great job on the clouds (Gosh I hope the skies did not open given that the roof was down. Nice S bend and diagonal leading line although I may have liked it even more if you had played with the straightening tool to give the effect of the car going up, rather than down hill.  Even as it is a very nice shot 8', '2007-12-10 14:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4306461, 620282, 68035, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot that I could imagine being used to sell this car, like the adverse camber effect of the road.  Possibly my only minor comment would be that colour wise it appears a little flat.  I''m not sure whether that was down to grey skies/time of day of the shot.<br/> <br/>Very nice sharpness on the car<br/> <br/>8 from me</td>', 'Very nice shot that I could imagine being used to sell this car, like the adverse camber effect of the road.  Possibly my only minor comment would be that colour wise it appears a little flat.  I''m not sure whether that was down to grey skies/time of day of the shot. Very nice sharpness on the car 8 from me', '2007-12-10 14:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4306463, 621087, 68035, '<td valign="top">Lovely idea that I could definitely imagine being used to sell this vehicle.  Love the sharpness on the car and the gentle bokeh backdrop which gets the ''selling message'' across without either losing too much detail or over powering the image<br/> <br/>Perhaps could have done with a little bit of a boost to the car colours but still an excellent 8</td>', 'Lovely idea that I could definitely imagine being used to sell this vehicle.  Love the sharpness on the car and the gentle bokeh backdrop which gets the ''selling message'' across without either losing too much detail or over powering the image Perhaps could have done with a little bit of a boost to the car colours but still an excellent 8', '2007-12-10 14:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4306465, 621106, 68035, '<td valign="top">really strong image, I love the way you have created a strong diagonal leading line with the car itself and the slight fish eye works very well.  You dont need me to tell you that the backfrop is stunning I am sure.  I guess my only minor complaint would be that the lighting set up that you have used almost makes it look as if the background is fake (ie posing in front of a painted backdrop) which is accentuated by the reflections in the cars body<br/> <br/>Still a very good shot - 8</td>', 'really strong image, I love the way you have created a strong diagonal leading line with the car itself and the slight fish eye works very well.  You dont need me to tell you that the backfrop is stunning I am sure.  I guess my only minor complaint would be that the lighting set up that you have used almost makes it look as if the background is fake (ie posing in front of a painted backdrop) which is accentuated by the reflections in the cars body Still a very good shot - 8', '2007-12-10 14:17:53.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4306466, 620831, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice shot...Love the strong diagonal created by the car and the use of fish eye here<br/> <br/>Stunning backdrop which really compliments the image and the selling idea of the strength of the car.  Great sharpness.  Maybe could have done with the reflections from your lighting rig at the front of the car being cloned out but still a super image 8</td>', 'Nice shot...Love the strong diagonal created by the car and the use of fish eye here Stunning backdrop which really compliments the image and the selling idea of the strength of the car.  Great sharpness.  Maybe could have done with the reflections from your lighting rig at the front of the car being cloned out but still a super image 8', '2007-12-10 14:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4306468, 621125, 68035, '<td valign="top">Maybe would not work as a stand alone image to sell the truck but I could definitely see this being used inside a brochure to convet the strength speed and cabin qualities.<br/> <br/>Possibly could have done with having the green LED reflections at the top of the windscreen being cloned out and the red band in the mid lower right of the image is a bit distracting (not sure what this is or whether anything could have been done to remove it)<br/> <br/>Very good image. 8</td>', 'Maybe would not work as a stand alone image to sell the truck but I could definitely see this being used inside a brochure to convet the strength speed and cabin qualities. Possibly could have done with having the green LED reflections at the top of the windscreen being cloned out and the red band in the mid lower right of the image is a bit distracting (not sure what this is or whether anything could have been done to remove it) Very good image. 8', '2007-12-10 14:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4306469, 620931, 68035, '<td valign="top">Definitely a BMW style picture that you could imagine being used on a brochure.  Very nice composition and the simplicity yet power of the background sets it off nicely.  Possibly could have done with a light touch of burning on the front of the car but a picture that meets the challenge criteria well</td>', 'Definitely a BMW style picture that you could imagine being used on a brochure.  Very nice composition and the simplicity yet power of the background sets it off nicely.  Possibly could have done with a light touch of burning on the front of the car but a picture that meets the challenge criteria well', '2007-12-10 14:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4306470, 620908, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and the dual image would work very well in selling this car.  Really like the use of high key in the top of the image which accentuates the car well.  Possibly could have done with being a touch sharper but still a great shot for the challenge 7</td>', 'Nice shot and the dual image would work very well in selling this car.  Really like the use of high key in the top of the image which accentuates the car well.  Possibly could have done with being a touch sharper but still a great shot for the challenge 7', '2007-12-10 14:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4306472, 621092, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice image, the b&amp;w conversion works well and there is something pleasantly understated about the car which does not detract from its beauty..  super set up and execution</td>', 'Nice image, the b&w conversion works well and there is something pleasantly understated about the car which does not detract from its beauty..  super set up and execution', '2007-12-10 14:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4306473, 620202, 68035, '<td valign="top">LOL very amusing take on the challenge which certainly would make anyone want to but one of those ancient behemoths<br/> <br/>Maybe could have done with desating the fence markers a touch as they are a tad distracting<br/> <br/>Nice shot though</td>', 'LOL very amusing take on the challenge which certainly would make anyone want to but one of those ancient behemoths Maybe could have done with desating the fence markers a touch as they are a tad distracting Nice shot though', '2007-12-10 14:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4306474, 621008, 68035, '<td valign="top">Lovely car and very well shot.  I just wonder whether given the cars colour and age whether it might have been worth going for a duotone image<br/> <br/>Certainly even as it is a very nice image that attracts the eye</td>', 'Lovely car and very well shot.  I just wonder whether given the cars colour and age whether it might have been worth going for a duotone image Certainly even as it is a very nice image that attracts the eye', '2007-12-10 14:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4306476, 621077, 68035, '<td valign="top">Great image of the car itself which looks like it could be taken directly from a magazine from the 50''s or 60''s.  Love the slightly muted colours  which help accentuate the ''aged'' feeling<br/> <br/>Bit of a shame about the people in the background who are a bit distracting and anomalous in terms of the image, but I guess there is not a lot you could do about them<br/> <br/>7</td>', 'Great image of the car itself which looks like it could be taken directly from a magazine from the 50''s or 60''s.  Love the slightly muted colours  which help accentuate the ''aged'' feeling Bit of a shame about the people in the background who are a bit distracting and anomalous in terms of the image, but I guess there is not a lot you could do about them 7', '2007-12-10 14:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4306477, 620838, 68035, '<td valign="top">Very nice showroom image.  Great colouring really gives the picture some pop.  A bit of a shame about the black car in the background (though I guess there is not a lot you could do about this).  I may have prefered just a little more space between the lexus and the edge of the frame (especially front lower right)but still a very good image 7</td>', 'Very nice showroom image.  Great colouring really gives the picture some pop.  A bit of a shame about the black car in the background (though I guess there is not a lot you could do about this).  I may have prefered just a little more space between the lexus and the edge of the frame (especially front lower right)but still a very good image 7', '2007-12-10 14:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4306478, 620945, 68035, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and a great backdrop.  Possibly could have done with a fractionally deeper dof as the rear end of the car seems slightly out of focus (and a bit dirty but only a mad person would suggest that you polished the car before the shot and after you had got to this location)<br/> <br/>Hope it sells for you - 7</td>', 'Very nice composition and a great backdrop.  Possibly could have done with a fractionally deeper dof as the rear end of the car seems slightly out of focus (and a bit dirty but only a mad person would suggest that you polished the car before the shot and after you had got to this location) Hope it sells for you - 7', '2007-12-10 14:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4306479, 621048, 68035, '<td valign="top">In many ways a very nice shot.  Love the composition and the reflection is superb.  The blurring of the background does help to draw the attention into the car but perhaps could have been graduated slight different as there is a bit of a halo around the vehicle which is slightly distracting and makes it appear almost as if you have over sharpened the shot<br/> <br/>7</td>', 'In many ways a very nice shot.  Love the composition and the reflection is superb.  The blurring of the background does help to draw the attention into the car but perhaps could have been graduated slight different as there is a bit of a halo around the vehicle which is slightly distracting and makes it appear almost as if you have over sharpened the shot 7', '2007-12-10 14:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4306480, 620539, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice shot amd the title works well for the challenge.  Very nice B&amp;W conversion (congrats on not getting blow out on the snow) and good sharpness</td>', 'Nice shot amd the title works well for the challenge.  Very nice B&W conversion (congrats on not getting blow out on the snow) and good sharpness', '2007-12-10 14:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4306481, 620348, 68035, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo and the duotone works really well.  Suoer sharpness on the car itself.  Compositionally strong with a good leading diagonal although it would have been great if you could have lost the roadside barrier.  Great to see gullwing doors as well (even if they do mean that you can never really park close to anybody).  Would I buy this car...heck yes</td>', 'Very nice photo and the duotone works really well.  Suoer sharpness on the car itself.  Compositionally strong with a good leading diagonal although it would have been great if you could have lost the roadside barrier.  Great to see gullwing doors as well (even if they do mean that you can never really park close to anybody).  Would I buy this car...heck yes', '2007-12-10 14:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4306482, 621047, 68035, '<td valign="top">Probably I will be the 435th person to say ... but but but that''s a BENTLEY!!!<br/> <br/>Nice shot that works well in the challenge, its a real shame that you had to shoot this through a window as the glass reflection is quite distracting (though hats off to you for the sharpness on the car given that you had to do this) 7</td>', 'Probably I will be the 435th person to say ... but but but that''s a BENTLEY!!! Nice shot that works well in the challenge, its a real shame that you had to shoot this through a window as the glass reflection is quite distracting (though hats off to you for the sharpness on the car given that you had to do this) 7', '2007-12-10 14:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4306484, 621105, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp shot although the wheels perhaps could have done with some slight dodging.  Possiblt a little ''flat'' in terms of the composition and it may have been an idea to rotate about 45 degrees in PP to have created a leading diagonal that crossed rule of third points 6</td>', 'Nice crisp shot although the wheels perhaps could have done with some slight dodging.  Possiblt a little ''flat'' in terms of the composition and it may have been an idea to rotate about 45 degrees in PP to have created a leading diagonal that crossed rule of third points 6', '2007-12-10 14:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4306485, 620520, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I like the fact that although the audi logo is bokeh there can be no mistaking what it is (great creation of bokeh light polygons as well).  Simple but effective I could not imagine this selling a car in itself but I could see it as a shot inside the brochure<br/> <br/>Like the thick top/bottom border but not keen on the uneven left/right border which I think is a bit distracting and maybe could have been omitted</td>', 'Nice shot, I like the fact that although the audi logo is bokeh there can be no mistaking what it is (great creation of bokeh light polygons as well).  Simple but effective I could not imagine this selling a car in itself but I could see it as a shot inside the brochure Like the thick top/bottom border but not keen on the uneven left/right border which I think is a bit distracting and maybe could have been omitted', '2007-12-10 14:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4306486, 620618, 68035, '<td valign="top">Compositionally super and the backdrop works very well for the challenge<br/> <br/>very nice sharpness on the car itself.  This nearly feels like a ribbon winner but (imo) what holds it back a little is the fact that the rear of the car is so dark.  I still think this will do well but pehaps if you had dodged the back a little it would have gone from good to great<br/> <br/>Generally very nice overall</td>', 'Compositionally super and the backdrop works very well for the challenge very nice sharpness on the car itself.  This nearly feels like a ribbon winner but (imo) what holds it back a little is the fact that the rear of the car is so dark.  I still think this will do well but pehaps if you had dodged the back a little it would have gone from good to great Generally very nice overall', '2007-12-10 14:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4306487, 620666, 68035, '<td valign="top">In my (limited) experience shots of toys dont tend to do well in challenges so if you are new to DPC and this doesnt score as well as you hoped this may be the reason<br/> <br/>Like the shot itself, you have good sharpness and colour and the reflection works.  Compositionally this is also good.<br/> <br/>Its hard to pick out any particular thing that I dont think you have done well but for some reason the picture seems to lack a real wow factor for the viewer - 6 from me</td>', 'In my (limited) experience shots of toys dont tend to do well in challenges so if you are new to DPC and this doesnt score as well as you hoped this may be the reason Like the shot itself, you have good sharpness and colour and the reflection works.  Compositionally this is also good. Its hard to pick out any particular thing that I dont think you have done well but for some reason the picture seems to lack a real wow factor for the viewer - 6 from me', '2007-12-10 14:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4306488, 620754, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice simple shot that has been well executed.  I like the centred composition and the external motion blur.  Good sharpness as well</td>', 'Nice simple shot that has been well executed.  I like the centred composition and the external motion blur.  Good sharpness as well', '2007-12-10 14:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4306489, 620837, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of two nice carsgood composition and sharpness although I find the reflections on their bodies and windshields a little overpowering (although I appreciate that there is not too much that you could do to avoid this).  Nice luse of the kerb to create a leading diagonal</td>', 'Nice shot of two nice carsgood composition and sharpness although I find the reflections on their bodies and windshields a little overpowering (although I appreciate that there is not too much that you could do to avoid this).  Nice luse of the kerb to create a leading diagonal', '2007-12-10 14:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4306539, 620283, 68586, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge and good to see something so different. Good crop, nice lighting and colours.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge and good to see something so different. Good crop, nice lighting and colours.', '2007-12-10 14:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4306557, 621091, 68586, '<td valign="top">If 100 Bucks includes shipping I mught just take it  :-  )<br/> <br/>The title fits the grungy beaten-up feel of this shot nicely. <br/> <br/>While this is true of so many adverts out there - I wonder if it is a little too stark ? Between the bumper (fender?) and the background there is an awful lot of black in this. I suspect if you were really trying to sell it you would take a very different picture  :-  )</td>', 'If 100 Bucks includes shipping I mught just take it  :-  ) The title fits the grungy beaten-up feel of this shot nicely.  While this is true of so many adverts out there - I wonder if it is a little too stark ? Between the bumper (fender?) and the background there is an awful lot of black in this. I suspect if you were really trying to sell it you would take a very different picture  :-  )', '2007-12-10 15:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4306561, 621002, 68586, '<td valign="top">Lovely shiny car, and great backdrop. <br/> <br/>Maybe the reflections on the screen and left headlight are a bit too bright ?</td>', 'Lovely shiny car, and great backdrop.  Maybe the reflections on the screen and left headlight are a bit too bright ?', '2007-12-10 15:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
