(4307928, 620979, 81382, '<td valign="top">Well composed. Shame you can''t clean it up a bit in post processing, I''m sure that if this was a real advert to go in a magazine then it would have been done in CGI. More of a branding thing than a car advert but still meets the challenge in my opinion.</td>', 'Well composed. Shame you can''t clean it up a bit in post processing, I''m sure that if this was a real advert to go in a magazine then it would have been done in CGI. More of a branding thing than a car advert but still meets the challenge in my opinion.', '2007-12-11 08:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
