(4307932, 621009, 81382, '<td valign="top">Large DOF which completely gives away the fact that this is a model. The focus should be on the front of the car, the headlights are the eyes of the car and so portrait photography rules should apply here. The focal point is mid way on the bonnet and so doesn''t look quite right.</td>', 'Large DOF which completely gives away the fact that this is a model. The focus should be on the front of the car, the headlights are the eyes of the car and so portrait photography rules should apply here. The focal point is mid way on the bonnet and so doesn''t look quite right.', '2007-12-11 08:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4307934, 620744, 77425, '<td valign="top">why is the face in the upper right in focus?</td>', 'why is the face in the upper right in focus?', '2007-12-11 08:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4307940, 620123, 81382, '<td valign="top">Taken from eye level. Most car photography articles on the internet say to try and avoid this and instead go for pretty much any other viewpoint to add interest as we all look at cars everyday from eye level - a suggested camera position to try would be just above wheel height. Well composed though, nice wide angle (another must on every site I have looked at). The horizon isn''t straight though, perhaps consider squaring it up or more purposely crop on an angle for dramatic effect</td>', 'Taken from eye level. Most car photography articles on the internet say to try and avoid this and instead go for pretty much any other viewpoint to add interest as we all look at cars everyday from eye level - a suggested camera position to try would be just above wheel height. Well composed though, nice wide angle (another must on every site I have looked at). The horizon isn''t straight though, perhaps consider squaring it up or more purposely crop on an angle for dramatic effect', '2007-12-11 08:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4307945, 620868, 73235, '<td valign="top">I find this picture not very attractive. I can''t identify what actually is in focus. Somehow I get the impression this is not done intentionally. On the other side title and dull colors supplement each other.</td>', 'I find this picture not very attractive. I can''t identify what actually is in focus. Somehow I get the impression this is not done intentionally. On the other side title and dull colors supplement each other.', '2007-12-11 08:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4307947, 620041, 73235, '<td valign="top">good b/w conversion to bring out the snow. snow and leaves support your title.</td>', 'good b/w conversion to bring out the snow. snow and leaves support your title.', '2007-12-11 08:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4307949, 620889, 81382, '<td valign="top">Lovely tones, good viewpoint - nice and low adds interest and gives the car more "authority" and makes for a more dramatic advert. Good sky, shame you have a relatively complicated background, would have been better if the buildings weren''t there. Composition wise, you might consider placing the car more to the right to give it room to "move into" on the left hand side given it is pointing to the left. You have less space on the left currently than on the right and so it is almost "moving" out of the frame. Good job on remembering to get rid of the number plate.</td>', 'Lovely tones, good viewpoint - nice and low adds interest and gives the car more "authority" and makes for a more dramatic advert. Good sky, shame you have a relatively complicated background, would have been better if the buildings weren''t there. Composition wise, you might consider placing the car more to the right to give it room to "move into" on the left hand side given it is pointing to the left. You have less space on the left currently than on the right and so it is almost "moving" out of the frame. Good job on remembering to get rid of the number plate.', '2007-12-11 08:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4307953, 621069, 73235, '<td valign="top">nice low perspective, good exposure to capture the white paint AND the clouds.</td>', 'nice low perspective, good exposure to capture the white paint AND the clouds.', '2007-12-11 08:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4307955, 620568, 81382, '<td valign="top">Not liking the red background, draws that eye away from the car which is completely the opposite of what an advert should do. The ARB sticker wouldn''t be present in an advert</td>', 'Not liking the red background, draws that eye away from the car which is completely the opposite of what an advert should do. The ARB sticker wouldn''t be present in an advert', '2007-12-11 09:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4307956, 621002, 73235, '<td valign="top">I dont know whether it''s on purpose or an accident: the reflection of the tree on the hood is a real nice touch supporting your title.</td>', 'I dont know whether it''s on purpose or an accident: the reflection of the tree on the hood is a real nice touch supporting your title.', '2007-12-11 09:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4307957, 620618, 73235, '<td valign="top">great capture of the mood and the intention of your pic. good composition. congrats: good work</td>', 'great capture of the mood and the intention of your pic. good composition. congrats: good work', '2007-12-11 09:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4307963, 621081, 36499, '<td valign="top">While I think this is a very good photo I thik a bit of dodging/burning on the buildings and the sky wouldve gave this photo the impact it deserves. the lighting is good but just way to even for my tastes. comp and focus are superb! good luck jamie<br/>~~Cher~~</td>', 'While I think this is a very good photo I thik a bit of dodging/burning on the buildings and the sky wouldve gave this photo the impact it deserves. the lighting is good but just way to even for my tastes. comp and focus are superb! good luck jamie~~Cher~~', '2007-12-11 09:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4307964, 620881, 36499, '<td valign="top">very nice..hope to see this with a blue...good luck<br/>~~Cher~~</td>', 'very nice..hope to see this with a blue...good luck~~Cher~~', '2007-12-11 09:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4307965, 621074, 36499, '<td valign="top">I love this AD but whites are a bit blown out. Next time try metering on your brightest spots then you can dodge the darker areas after you adjust your neutrals. good luck and If you have any questions just ask and Ill try to help.<br/>~~Cher~~</td>', 'I love this AD but whites are a bit blown out. Next time try metering on your brightest spots then you can dodge the darker areas after you adjust your neutrals. good luck and If you have any questions just ask and Ill try to help.~~Cher~~', '2007-12-11 09:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4307966, 620618, 36499, '<td valign="top">Very Nice view there! only thing I think would make this better (for me personaly) is to see the back of the vehicle too.good luck<br/>~~Cher~~</td>', 'Very Nice view there! only thing I think would make this better (for me personaly) is to see the back of the vehicle too.good luck~~Cher~~', '2007-12-11 09:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4307967, 620977, 36499, '<td valign="top">Ooooh...NICE!everything here looks great except for the tree reflection on the hood...I think I wouldve cloned that out.I love the simple but elegant border..nice choice.Good luck<br/>~~Cher~~</td>', 'Ooooh...NICE!everything here looks great except for the tree reflection on the hood...I think I wouldve cloned that out.I love the simple but elegant border..nice choice.Good luck~~Cher~~', '2007-12-11 09:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4307968, 620908, 36499, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah..theres the car for me. I love the creative way you presented it here. very unique to this challenge. very nicely done..hope to see this one at the top.Good luck<br/>~~Cher~~</td>', 'Oh yeah..theres the car for me. I love the creative way you presented it here. very unique to this challenge. very nicely done..hope to see this one at the top.Good luck~~Cher~~', '2007-12-11 09:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4307969, 620202, 36499, '<td valign="top">wow! A POS and an EOS..what a deal...lol nice editing but the oranges are a bit bright.good luck<br/>~~Cher~~</td>', 'wow! A POS and an EOS..what a deal...lol nice editing but the oranges are a bit bright.good luck~~Cher~~', '2007-12-11 09:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4307970, 621069, 36499, '<td valign="top">I like the different perspective of this one and the sky is really nice! good luck<br/>~~Cher~~</td>', 'I like the different perspective of this one and the sky is really nice! good luck~~Cher~~', '2007-12-11 09:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4307971, 620539, 36499, '<td valign="top">While I like the editing of this, I think a wider crop wouldve benefited this photo. Also if you meter for the brightest spot you can avoid the blown highlights(snow &amp; chrome). your focus and comp look pretty good to me. good luck<br/>~~Cher~~</td>', 'While I like the editing of this, I think a wider crop wouldve benefited this photo. Also if you meter for the brightest spot you can avoid the blown highlights(snow & chrome). your focus and comp look pretty good to me. good luck~~Cher~~', '2007-12-11 09:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4307972, 620002, 36499, '<td valign="top">heeeheee...i love his expression! creative idea using a powerwheel! good luck!<br/>~~Cher~~</td>', 'heeeheee...i love his expression! creative idea using a powerwheel! good luck!~~Cher~~', '2007-12-11 09:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4307973, 621051, 36499, '<td valign="top">WOW! when this poped up on my screen I felt like i was moving! awesome! great focus and colors...I fully expect to see this one at the top! Good luck!<br/>~~Cher~~</td>', 'WOW! when this poped up on my screen I felt like i was moving! awesome! great focus and colors...I fully expect to see this one at the top! Good luck!~~Cher~~', '2007-12-11 09:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4307974, 620348, 36499, '<td valign="top">that is one sweet lookin car! Love the processing..perfect for this "old timer". good luck<br/>~~Cher~~</td>', 'that is one sweet lookin car! Love the processing..perfect for this "old timer". good luck~~Cher~~', '2007-12-11 09:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4307975, 620283, 36499, '<td valign="top">While i really like the editing and the feel of this photo i really dont care for the angle. I feel like Im gonna fall over..lol maybe if the angle of the car was going up the left instead it wouldnt feel so harsh..Good luck<br/>~~Cher~~</td>', 'While i really like the editing and the feel of this photo i really dont care for the angle. I feel like Im gonna fall over..lol maybe if the angle of the car was going up the left instead it wouldnt feel so harsh..Good luck~~Cher~~', '2007-12-11 09:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4307976, 621027, 36499, '<td valign="top">simple and to the point...and this makes me want to go check the car out somewhere. love the blue...good luck<br/>~~Cher~~</td>', 'simple and to the point...and this makes me want to go check the car out somewhere. love the blue...good luck~~Cher~~', '2007-12-11 09:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4307977, 620744, 36499, '<td valign="top">Great title to go with this tho I would have liketo have seen more of the truck in frame...good luck<br/>~~Cher~~</td>', 'Great title to go with this tho I would have liketo have seen more of the truck in frame...good luck~~Cher~~', '2007-12-11 09:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4307978, 621009, 36499, '<td valign="top">Love the strong colors,shallow DOF and a good matching simple boreder...very nicely done.(looks real too) Good luck<br/>~~Cher~~</td>', 'Love the strong colors,shallow DOF and a good matching simple boreder...very nicely done.(looks real too) Good luck~~Cher~~', '2007-12-11 09:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4307979, 620989, 36499, '<td valign="top">hee hee...lovely title.I think this photo couldve had a ton of impact with processing done in color and a ton of dodging and burning done to it...maybe gave it more of that "dirty grunge" look. just my opinion..good luck<br/>~~Cher~~</td>', 'hee hee...lovely title.I think this photo couldve had a ton of impact with processing done in color and a ton of dodging and burning done to it...maybe gave it more of that "dirty grunge" look. just my opinion..good luck~~Cher~~', '2007-12-11 09:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4307980, 620683, 36499, '<td valign="top">I actually find this photo a bit funny...they want to sell you a car that expensive and they put a cheap plastic "dollar tree" bow on it...lol. great comp and all that...I think a white border wouldve set this off a bit better (IMO)good luck<br/>~~Cher~~</td>', 'I actually find this photo a bit funny...they want to sell you a car that expensive and they put a cheap plastic "dollar tree" bow on it...lol. great comp and all that...I think a white border wouldve set this off a bit better (IMO)good luck~~Cher~~', '2007-12-11 09:11:43.000000', NULL, 1);
