(4307989, 621077, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very much like the vintage illustrated ads of the era in style and feel...this is awesome.  A real sense of depth and dimension to this as well.  The only way to improve this is if the people looked vintage...damn people should learn how to dress properly!  BOC, by a long shot!!!<br/> <br/>Good grief...how can I not favorite this!</td>', 'Very much like the vintage illustrated ads of the era in style and feel...this is awesome.  A real sense of depth and dimension to this as well.  The only way to improve this is if the people looked vintage...damn people should learn how to dress properly!  BOC, by a long shot!!! Good grief...how can I not favorite this!', '2007-12-11 09:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4307990, 620666, 36499, '<td valign="top">billy??? everything about this is perfect for me..i love the reflection..good luck. hope to see this at the top!<br/>~~Cher~~</td>', 'billy??? everything about this is perfect for me..i love the reflection..good luck. hope to see this at the top!~~Cher~~', '2007-12-11 09:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
