(4307996, 620202, 73235, '<td valign="top">Surely you have a lot of requests about the location of this dealer. Just add me to this list :) Your capture and PP supports the idea of this run-down used car dealer pretty well.</td>', 'Surely you have a lot of requests about the location of this dealer. Just add me to this list :) Your capture and PP supports the idea of this run-down used car dealer pretty well.', '2007-12-11 09:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
