(4309353, 620831, 55987, '<td valign="top">Hey, what lens did you use for this?</td>', 'Hey, what lens did you use for this?', '2007-12-11 23:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4309358, 621047, 55987, '<td valign="top">dreaming of a rolls, but a picture of a bentley...</td>', 'dreaming of a rolls, but a picture of a bentley...', '2007-12-11 23:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4309359, 620921, 53814, '<td valign="top">A wonderful, inspirational composition. Your use of minimalism to create mystery is masterful and is topped off by the contrasting texture and color of the metal and brick. Excellent -10</td>', 'A wonderful, inspirational composition. Your use of minimalism to create mystery is masterful and is topped off by the contrasting texture and color of the metal and brick. Excellent -10', '2007-12-11 23:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4309713, 621087, 83650, '<td valign="top">Ahh, Silver Pine Mica paintjob - the epitome of a hybrid color.  Perfect backdrop.  Putting this car in front of a few H2''s filling up at a gas station would have been hilarious. ;-)</td>', 'Ahh, Silver Pine Mica paintjob - the epitome of a hybrid color.  Perfect backdrop.  Putting this car in front of a few H2''s filling up at a gas station would have been hilarious. ;-)', '2007-12-12 02:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4309718, 620744, 83650, '<td valign="top">The first thing that catches my eye is the in-focus picture of a man''s smiling face on the side of a bus?? or a van?? in the upper right hand corner compared to the slightly out-of-focus line of men standing looking at the truck.  If that man''s face wasn''t there, I would give this one a 9.</td>', 'The first thing that catches my eye is the in-focus picture of a man''s smiling face on the side of a bus?? or a van?? in the upper right hand corner compared to the slightly out-of-focus line of men standing looking at the truck.  If that man''s face wasn''t there, I would give this one a 9.', '2007-12-12 03:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4309723, 620977, 83650, '<td valign="top">I can''t decide whether or not the tree reflection helps or hinders this shot.  I like the lighting on the hood.  A more symmetrical chrome reflection on the middle grill would be appealing. 7</td>', 'I can''t decide whether or not the tree reflection helps or hinders this shot.  I like the lighting on the hood.  A more symmetrical chrome reflection on the middle grill would be appealing. 7', '2007-12-12 03:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4309727, 620520, 83650, '<td valign="top">Without the description, the blur on the Audi logo is a bit too heavy for many non-Audi enthusiasts to make out.  I would give this one an 8 if the logo could be more recognizable.</td>', 'Without the description, the blur on the Audi logo is a bit too heavy for many non-Audi enthusiasts to make out.  I would give this one an 8 if the logo could be more recognizable.', '2007-12-12 03:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4309736, 621051, 83650, '<td valign="top">I believe I can say it.... Nailed it!  Too bad the sun wasn''t more to the front of the Porsche and behind the camera.  A trailing shadow would look more ideal than a leading one.  Oh well, we''re not God. ;-)</td>', 'I believe I can say it.... Nailed it!  Too bad the sun wasn''t more to the front of the Porsche and behind the camera.  A trailing shadow would look more ideal than a leading one.  Oh well, we''re not God. ;-)', '2007-12-12 03:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4309741, 621067, 83650, '<td valign="top">Rear wheel drive in snow...in a field no less?! :-p</td>', 'Rear wheel drive in snow...in a field no less?! :-p', '2007-12-12 03:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4309748, 620931, 83650, '<td valign="top">I probably won''t be the only one to say it, but that little tree needs to go.  The sky is perfect for this shot, but the dirt behind the blacktop, imo, "cheapens" the BMW.  But all in all, still a good shot.</td>', 'I probably won''t be the only one to say it, but that little tree needs to go.  The sky is perfect for this shot, but the dirt behind the blacktop, imo, "cheapens" the BMW.  But all in all, still a good shot.', '2007-12-12 03:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4309755, 620618, 83650, '<td valign="top">Too bad the suv''s brand wasn''t there in place of the "Motors" on the spare wheel cover.  A reflector hitting the rear would have been nice to brighten it up a little.</td>', 'Too bad the suv''s brand wasn''t there in place of the "Motors" on the spare wheel cover.  A reflector hitting the rear would have been nice to brighten it up a little.', '2007-12-12 03:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4309765, 620921, 83650, '<td valign="top">*need more cowbell*  Need more car!  Show that thing off.</td>', '*need more cowbell*  Need more car!  Show that thing off.', '2007-12-12 03:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4309912, 620002, 65035, '<td valign="top">Ha, love the expression on his face, great concept well done.</td>', 'Ha, love the expression on his face, great concept well done.', '2007-12-12 05:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4309915, 620677, 65035, '<td valign="top">Ouch! Cool idea for the challenge.</td>', 'Ouch! Cool idea for the challenge.', '2007-12-12 05:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4309919, 620921, 65035, '<td valign="top">Very cool, nice composition.</td>', 'Very cool, nice composition.', '2007-12-12 05:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4309922, 621092, 65035, '<td valign="top">Wow those trees are gorgeous, the whole setting is stunning. You managed to make a Ford look classy, well done!</td>', 'Wow those trees are gorgeous, the whole setting is stunning. You managed to make a Ford look classy, well done!', '2007-12-12 05:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4309924, 621091, 65035, '<td valign="top">Hehe this is clever, I get the feeling that this is it''s good side.</td>', 'Hehe this is clever, I get the feeling that this is it''s good side.', '2007-12-12 05:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4309928, 620282, 65035, '<td valign="top">Very classy shot. Love the angle and the background colours tone perfectly with the car.</td>', 'Very classy shot. Love the angle and the background colours tone perfectly with the car.', '2007-12-12 05:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4309931, 621077, 65035, '<td valign="top">Ooooo that''s nice...great processing.</td>', 'Ooooo that''s nice...great processing.', '2007-12-12 05:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4309934, 621010, 65035, '<td valign="top">This works well somehow, great title.</td>', 'This works well somehow, great title.', '2007-12-12 05:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4309939, 621051, 85374, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2007-12-12 05:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4309942, 620348, 65035, '<td valign="top">Stunning car and beautiful processing, I just wish that guard rail wasn''t there. Is asking you to dismantle a guard rail to get a better shot too much?</td>', 'Stunning car and beautiful processing, I just wish that guard rail wasn''t there. Is asking you to dismantle a guard rail to get a better shot too much?', '2007-12-12 05:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310110, 620618, 84552, '<td valign="top">just beautiful</td>', 'just beautiful', '2007-12-12 07:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310124, 621087, 3746, '<td valign="top">OK, the composition with the dirty background works really well here, so a few extra marks for that. good effort. Hope to see this in top 10.</td>', 'OK, the composition with the dirty background works really well here, so a few extra marks for that. good effort. Hope to see this in top 10.', '2007-12-12 07:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310125, 621051, 3746, '<td valign="top">Nice speed blur but the car in perfect focus. THe sky/clouds all work well..  you nailed this shot!</td>', 'Nice speed blur but the car in perfect focus. THe sky/clouds all work well..  you nailed this shot!', '2007-12-12 07:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310127, 620977, 3746, '<td valign="top">Dark, moody, would look great in a magazine. well done.</td>', 'Dark, moody, would look great in a magazine. well done.', '2007-12-12 07:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310128, 621074, 3746, '<td valign="top">If you had used a longer lens and had the hummer in focus whilst blurring the background this would of worked better.. A bit flat looking overall.</td>', 'If you had used a longer lens and had the hummer in focus whilst blurring the background this would of worked better.. A bit flat looking overall.', '2007-12-12 07:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310129, 620823, 3746, '<td valign="top">Good effort, but not enough interest in the shot for me..</td>', 'Good effort, but not enough interest in the shot for me..', '2007-12-12 07:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310132, 620917, 3746, '<td valign="top">Good processing work on this. You put the vehicle in its correct environment which makes it a better shot.. well done. 7</td>', 'Good processing work on this. You put the vehicle in its correct environment which makes it a better shot.. well done. 7', '2007-12-12 07:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310133, 620677, 3746, '<td valign="top">I have seen several fo these ads in the past (generally emailed from other people).. they never fail to make me laugh, did you see the one with the DJ in the UK who said on-air he would love to sleep with his wifes sister..  When he got home she had sold his beloved Lotus sportscar.. thanks for the laugh.</td>', 'I have seen several fo these ads in the past (generally emailed from other people).. they never fail to make me laugh, did you see the one with the DJ in the UK who said on-air he would love to sleep with his wifes sister..  When he got home she had sold his beloved Lotus sportscar.. thanks for the laugh.', '2007-12-12 07:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310135, 620283, 3746, '<td valign="top">no really an ad in the truest sense. and I am currently in a period of coming down a bit harder on those who done nail the challenge. real good shot though with nice tones. 6</td>', 'no really an ad in the truest sense. and I am currently in a period of coming down a bit harder on those who done nail the challenge. real good shot though with nice tones. 6', '2007-12-12 07:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310143, 621081, 3746, '<td valign="top">The tagline really helps the image here - not in a shoehorning kinda way either. The image is great, good reflections on the car and placed in the correct environment.  well done!</td>', 'The tagline really helps the image here - not in a shoehorning kinda way either. The image is great, good reflections on the car and placed in the correct environment.  well done!', '2007-12-12 07:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310146, 620837, 3746, '<td valign="top">The reflections on the windows are very distracting, a Circular Polariser would of helped to cut these back a bit.. a deep DOF leaves this shot feeling rather flat.</td>', 'The reflections on the windows are very distracting, a Circular Polariser would of helped to cut these back a bit.. a deep DOF leaves this shot feeling rather flat.', '2007-12-12 07:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310148, 621094, 3746, '<td valign="top">OK, you are going to get stung by the voters on the post-processing here. if you check out real car-ads they keep the cars are clear as possible. Also, you really need to put this car into the correct environment, such as on the open road as this is a great touring car. Sitting outside a house doesnt do it any justice.. sorry, but one of the weaker entries.</td>', 'OK, you are going to get stung by the voters on the post-processing here. if you check out real car-ads they keep the cars are clear as possible. Also, you really need to put this car into the correct environment, such as on the open road as this is a great touring car. Sitting outside a house doesnt do it any justice.. sorry, but one of the weaker entries.', '2007-12-12 07:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310149, 620785, 3746, '<td valign="top">I am not liking the toycar being used here. This has a very snapshot feel to it, and as such, will probably score averagely overall. nothing in this shot excites me or provokes a reaction.. sorry.</td>', 'I am not liking the toycar being used here. This has a very snapshot feel to it, and as such, will probably score averagely overall. nothing in this shot excites me or provokes a reaction.. sorry.', '2007-12-12 07:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310151, 620568, 3746, '<td valign="top">The post-processing on this shot is horrendous. The background does nothing for me, and the angle is so-so.. sorry but I am not liking this shot.</td>', 'The post-processing on this shot is horrendous. The background does nothing for me, and the angle is so-so.. sorry but I am not liking this shot.', '2007-12-12 07:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310154, 620979, 3746, '<td valign="top">A good generic shot. clear and crisp. but other than that not much to get me excited.</td>', 'A good generic shot. clear and crisp. but other than that not much to get me excited.', '2007-12-12 07:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310157, 620520, 3746, '<td valign="top">Very good shot, shows the make and model, interesting angle and cool lighting. should do well.</td>', 'Very good shot, shows the make and model, interesting angle and cool lighting. should do well.', '2007-12-12 08:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310160, 620925, 3746, '<td valign="top">Not bad, doesnt really provoke any reactions except in maybe other Jag owners.</td>', 'Not bad, doesnt really provoke any reactions except in maybe other Jag owners.', '2007-12-12 08:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310166, 620889, 3746, '<td valign="top">Good angle but would of liked to see a shallower DOF so some of that background was blurred out. The BW conversion is very flat, look at some of the tutorials on using Channel mixer to convert to BW to make it `pop` more.</td>', 'Good angle but would of liked to see a shallower DOF so some of that background was blurred out. The BW conversion is very flat, look at some of the tutorials on using Channel mixer to convert to BW to make it `pop` more.', '2007-12-12 08:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310172, 620041, 3746, '<td valign="top">Quite a dull BW conversion, but good angle. I am thinking ina  real car ad, they may of shown the car without a sprinkling of snow/frost to show it is `untouchable` in cold weather. Otherwise quite a good shot.</td>', 'Quite a dull BW conversion, but good angle. I am thinking ina  real car ad, they may of shown the car without a sprinkling of snow/frost to show it is `untouchable` in cold weather. Otherwise quite a good shot.', '2007-12-12 08:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310174, 620348, 3746, '<td valign="top">Photo is very dark overall, also a lot of jaggies in some of the straight lines detract slightly from the shot. The use of sepia is a good choice to show the vintage of the car. but the overall darkness really bugs me.. good. 6</td>', 'Photo is very dark overall, also a lot of jaggies in some of the straight lines detract slightly from the shot. The use of sepia is a good choice to show the vintage of the car. but the overall darkness really bugs me.. good. 6', '2007-12-12 08:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310177, 620538, 3746, '<td valign="top">Dull flat and uninspiring shot. If this was bigger it may of worked better, but its just a wee bit boring to excite me in any way.</td>', 'Dull flat and uninspiring shot. If this was bigger it may of worked better, but its just a wee bit boring to excite me in any way.', '2007-12-12 08:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310187, 619771, 3746, '<td valign="top">The title didnt need to be that long.  OK, the shot is good, the contrast is very good, I am wondering if they has been a little out of the rule editing going on here, but I will let it pass.. a good all-round shot that should place in the top 20.</td>', 'The title didnt need to be that long.  OK, the shot is good, the contrast is very good, I am wondering if they has been a little out of the rule editing going on here, but I will let it pass.. a good all-round shot that should place in the top 20.', '2007-12-12 08:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310213, 621054, 3746, '<td valign="top">I am struggling to comment on this one (trying to comment all images in this challenge) - its really quite average. It doesnt excite me or provoke any emotions, but on the other hand, its technically a good photo..  6</td>', 'I am struggling to comment on this one (trying to comment all images in this challenge) - its really quite average. It doesnt excite me or provoke any emotions, but on the other hand, its technically a good photo..  6', '2007-12-12 08:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310218, 620282, 3746, '<td valign="top">Good angle and nice to have the car placed in an environment - should be top ten.</td>', 'Good angle and nice to have the car placed in an environment - should be top ten.', '2007-12-12 08:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310222, 621069, 3746, '<td valign="top">Sky is good, angle is interesting, but there is little else to say really.. nice and sharp I suppose.  good.</td>', 'Sky is good, angle is interesting, but there is little else to say really.. nice and sharp I suppose.  good.', '2007-12-12 08:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310223, 621128, 3746, '<td valign="top">Not really a good car ad shot. distinctly average.</td>', 'Not really a good car ad shot. distinctly average.', '2007-12-12 08:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310225, 620666, 3746, '<td valign="top">Not a bad effort - should place in top 20.</td>', 'Not a bad effort - should place in top 20.', '2007-12-12 08:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310230, 621027, 3746, '<td valign="top">DOesnt tell me anything about a car, so as an ad it falls down.. Car manufactureres can get away with teaser campaigns as they will eventually show a final product, but here you had one shot to `sell me` the car with your advert..</td>', 'DOesnt tell me anything about a car, so as an ad it falls down.. Car manufactureres can get away with teaser campaigns as they will eventually show a final product, but here you had one shot to `sell me` the car with your advert..', '2007-12-12 08:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310236, 620754, 3746, '<td valign="top">Not bad overall, just a tad mundane really. Nie having the speed blur at the sides of the shot though. 6</td>', 'Not bad overall, just a tad mundane really. Nie having the speed blur at the sides of the shot though. 6', '2007-12-12 08:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310240, 620704, 3746, '<td valign="top">Very snapshotty.  This would of benefitted from being in a better envvironment. Also it is cropped incredibly tightly. average.</td>', 'Very snapshotty.  This would of benefitted from being in a better envvironment. Also it is cropped incredibly tightly. average.', '2007-12-12 08:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310242, 621009, 3746, '<td valign="top">Lighting is poor, subject is boring and generally a below average shot. sorry. 4</td>', 'Lighting is poor, subject is boring and generally a below average shot. sorry. 4', '2007-12-12 08:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310268, 620861, 3746, '<td valign="top">not really digging the toy-car shots in this challenge, but this is slightly better than the others. 6</td>', 'not really digging the toy-car shots in this challenge, but this is slightly better than the others. 6', '2007-12-12 08:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310273, 621094, 81382, '<td valign="top">Great wide angle, glad you avoided the eye-level viewpoint. Hard, gritty colours are nice but conflict with an almost Christmasy feel I''m getting. Would have been better on just tarmac with a neural background. Looks as if only one of the main lights is working - not sure if you ment that or not</td>', 'Great wide angle, glad you avoided the eye-level viewpoint. Hard, gritty colours are nice but conflict with an almost Christmasy feel I''m getting. Would have been better on just tarmac with a neural background. Looks as if only one of the main lights is working - not sure if you ment that or not', '2007-12-12 08:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310275, 621048, 3746, '<td valign="top">way too much processing on this. Poor masking job really detracts fro this shot.</td>', 'way too much processing on this. Poor masking job really detracts fro this shot.', '2007-12-12 08:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310280, 620520, 81382, '<td valign="top">More branding than a specific car but still passes as an automobile advert. Perhaps Audi would have wanted their four-rings logo more visible and not disguised so much by bokeh. Not sure about the border, think you''ve gone for the widescreen TV borders.</td>', 'More branding than a specific car but still passes as an automobile advert. Perhaps Audi would have wanted their four-rings logo more visible and not disguised so much by bokeh. Not sure about the border, think you''ve gone for the widescreen TV borders.', '2007-12-12 08:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310285, 620945, 3746, '<td valign="top">Nice to see this placed in a decent envirunment, but overall the shot lacks any punch.</td>', 'Nice to see this placed in a decent envirunment, but overall the shot lacks any punch.', '2007-12-12 08:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310286, 620539, 81382, '<td valign="top">The headlights are the eyes of a car. If this was a portrait of a person, you might not want to have one of the eyes half cropped out of the image. Tonal seem a little on the light side, could do with pushing the bottom end to balance it out a little bit</td>', 'The headlights are the eyes of a car. If this was a portrait of a person, you might not want to have one of the eyes half cropped out of the image. Tonal seem a little on the light side, could do with pushing the bottom end to balance it out a little bit', '2007-12-12 08:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310287, 621047, 3746, '<td valign="top">very snapshotty and not like a car ad at all..</td>', 'very snapshotty and not like a car ad at all..', '2007-12-12 08:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310291, 620202, 3746, '<td valign="top">not a very good exmaple of a car ad - the title is too drawn out as well.</td>', 'not a very good exmaple of a car ad - the title is too drawn out as well.', '2007-12-12 08:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310292, 621010, 3746, '<td valign="top">good idea, but not very well executed. doesnt excite me or provoke any emotions.</td>', 'good idea, but not very well executed. doesnt excite me or provoke any emotions.', '2007-12-12 08:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310293, 621002, 3746, '<td valign="top">bit too flat to warrant a high score. a bit more depth would of helped.</td>', 'bit too flat to warrant a high score. a bit more depth would of helped.', '2007-12-12 08:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310295, 621077, 33361, '<td valign="top">Fabulous retro!!!</td>', 'Fabulous retro!!!', '2007-12-12 08:44:54.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4310296, 620348, 33361, '<td valign="top">I think the bridge detracts from this... but I love the car, tones and lighting!</td>', 'I think the bridge detracts from this... but I love the car, tones and lighting!', '2007-12-12 08:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310297, 620677, 33361, '<td valign="top">God this is funny!</td>', 'God this is funny!', '2007-12-12 08:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310298, 620618, 81382, '<td valign="top">Perhaps keeping your composition concept the same, but achieving it by using a much wider aspect ratio and getting the whole car in frame. Lovely lighting and focus on the side of the car, perhaps a little too dark at the rear though, I imagine a car manufacturer would want it more visible and also to show the whole thing</td>', 'Perhaps keeping your composition concept the same, but achieving it by using a much wider aspect ratio and getting the whole car in frame. Lovely lighting and focus on the side of the car, perhaps a little too dark at the rear though, I imagine a car manufacturer would want it more visible and also to show the whole thing', '2007-12-12 08:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310301, 621092, 3746, '<td valign="top">I would of liked to see this in colour. The BW is a bit flat for my liking.</td>', 'I would of liked to see this in colour. The BW is a bit flat for my liking.', '2007-12-12 08:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310305, 621105, 81382, '<td valign="top">Another model, I''ve never seen a model used in a car advert, CGI maybe, but not a model. I think the intention of the brief was to photograph a real car in some situation or other and not do a still life which is what this essentially is. Lighting has made it very specular and not evenly light, you have a real hotspot in the centre which tails off quite unaturally towards the edges.</td>', 'Another model, I''ve never seen a model used in a car advert, CGI maybe, but not a model. I think the intention of the brief was to photograph a real car in some situation or other and not do a still life which is what this essentially is. Lighting has made it very specular and not evenly light, you have a real hotspot in the centre which tails off quite unaturally towards the edges.', '2007-12-12 08:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310308, 621067, 3746, '<td valign="top">Not bad, better than a lot in the challenge.</td>', 'Not bad, better than a lot in the challenge.', '2007-12-12 08:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310327, 620837, 81382, '<td valign="top">Very wide border, whats going on there. The woman is a bit distracting. Nice clean cars but real adverts tend to have missing number plates or neutral ones so the same image can be used in marketing campaigns in various worldwide territories. A big yellow number plate at the front, for me in the UK, is very distracting and rather spoils the shot for me. Perhaps you could have post processed them out. Also, taken from eye-level which is pretty boring, a ground level shot, with a really wide angle lens to get some of the building in behind - "going up in the world" looking from ground to sky type concept would have worked well with your title</td>', 'Very wide border, whats going on there. The woman is a bit distracting. Nice clean cars but real adverts tend to have missing number plates or neutral ones so the same image can be used in marketing campaigns in various worldwide territories. A big yellow number plate at the front, for me in the UK, is very distracting and rather spoils the shot for me. Perhaps you could have post processed them out. Also, taken from eye-level which is pretty boring, a ground level shot, with a really wide angle lens to get some of the building in behind - "going up in the world" looking from ground to sky type concept would have worked well with your title', '2007-12-12 08:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310332, 621008, 3746, '<td valign="top">Nice to see a classic in hrere.  The sky looks good, would of been better with a few stars in there.. but good overall.</td>', 'Nice to see a classic in hrere.  The sky looks good, would of been better with a few stars in there.. but good overall.', '2007-12-12 08:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310335, 621091, 3746, '<td valign="top">not a great shot.. flat, boring and poor processing. sorry. 4</td>', 'not a great shot.. flat, boring and poor processing. sorry. 4', '2007-12-12 08:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
