(4310362, 621048, 3698, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderfull shot. This looks like what Audi would want in thier advertising. No background, simple beauty. Just the car! I really think this answeres the challenge, correctly. and i am not saying this because I have an Audi, (1990) because I have always loved Chevys! this is just the perfect ad shot! I would give this one a 10!</td>', 'This is a wonderfull shot. This looks like what Audi would want in thier advertising. No background, simple beauty. Just the car! I really think this answeres the challenge, correctly. and i am not saying this because I have an Audi, (1990) because I have always loved Chevys! this is just the perfect ad shot! I would give this one a 10!', '2007-12-12 09:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4310363, 620881, 3746, '<td valign="top">Great to see some vintage motors in this challenge.  You picked a good environment to place the car, the sky looks great. My only nitpick is the jaggies in the line along the edge of the car. but will not mark you down for that..  This is my pick for one of the top 3..</td>', 'Great to see some vintage motors in this challenge.  You picked a good environment to place the car, the sky looks great. My only nitpick is the jaggies in the line along the edge of the car. but will not mark you down for that..  This is my pick for one of the top 3..', '2007-12-12 09:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
