(4311552, 621105, 67152, '<td valign="top">i am not sure about the choice of composition - the angle really doesn''t draw me into the image very much and reinforces the really boxy feel of the car (albeit a toy here)</td>', 'i am not sure about the choice of composition - the angle really doesn''t draw me into the image very much and reinforces the really boxy feel of the car (albeit a toy here)', '2007-12-12 17:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311554, 621054, 67152, '<td valign="top">gotta love the grill on this beauty! I am not sure about the crop on the right - I almost think a wider crop to include both headlights would have worked better - still it is a really solid image 8</td>', 'gotta love the grill on this beauty! I am not sure about the crop on the right - I almost think a wider crop to include both headlights would have worked better - still it is a really solid image 8', '2007-12-12 17:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311556, 620348, 67152, '<td valign="top">very cool car - gotta love the doors on that thing.  i am not particularly fond of the choice of sepia here - the tone really does not draw me in.  In addition, I would rather see this from a front back view rather than back front view.</td>', 'very cool car - gotta love the doors on that thing.  i am not particularly fond of the choice of sepia here - the tone really does not draw me in.  In addition, I would rather see this from a front back view rather than back front view.', '2007-12-12 17:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311559, 620785, 67152, '<td valign="top">Nice shallow DOF on this toy car - not a big fan of the composition, but you have done well to display this.  6</td>', 'Nice shallow DOF on this toy car - not a big fan of the composition, but you have done well to display this.  6', '2007-12-12 17:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311562, 621069, 67152, '<td valign="top">nice perspective shot - the choice of the dramatic sky works really well to frame the car.  I don''t think the car color really works in this photo however - a bit too much white.</td>', 'nice perspective shot - the choice of the dramatic sky works really well to frame the car.  I don''t think the car color really works in this photo however - a bit too much white.', '2007-12-12 17:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311568, 621087, 67152, '<td valign="top">good use of background to get your point across.  The lighting and DOF works really well here.  I just think that a slightly different angle so we see the front of the car a bit would have just made this a bit better</td>', 'good use of background to get your point across.  The lighting and DOF works really well here.  I just think that a slightly different angle so we see the front of the car a bit would have just made this a bit better', '2007-12-12 17:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311571, 620823, 67152, '<td valign="top">nice concept shot.  you have chosen a really dramatic and easily recognized brand.  I just think a bit more gloss and higher contrast would have even made this one jump a bit more.</td>', 'nice concept shot.  you have chosen a really dramatic and easily recognized brand.  I just think a bit more gloss and higher contrast would have even made this one jump a bit more.', '2007-12-12 17:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311573, 620881, 67152, '<td valign="top">Excellent stuff.  Where do I buy one.  Great feel, wonderful and beautiful automobile, and fantastic photo. 10</td>', 'Excellent stuff.  Where do I buy one.  Great feel, wonderful and beautiful automobile, and fantastic photo. 10', '2007-12-12 17:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311577, 621048, 67152, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  I like the reflection and the smooth ground to reflect.I am not sure about the severe blurring of the background.  It gives the car a strange ghosting effect around the edges.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  I like the reflection and the smooth ground to reflect.I am not sure about the severe blurring of the background.  It gives the car a strange ghosting effect around the edges.', '2007-12-12 17:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311583, 620889, 67152, '<td valign="top">Pretty sky to complement a nice looking car.  I think a bit sharper focus on the car and more shine would really bring out the car.  In addition, the houses in the background a pretty large distraction to the shot.  Lastly, I closer shot with more sky may have worked better without having to even move the car.  By going wider angle but getting closer - we could get a sense of the big-ness of the car and see the nice lines that it has.  Still - good work.</td>', 'Pretty sky to complement a nice looking car.  I think a bit sharper focus on the car and more shine would really bring out the car.  In addition, the houses in the background a pretty large distraction to the shot.  Lastly, I closer shot with more sky may have worked better without having to even move the car.  By going wider angle but getting closer - we could get a sense of the big-ness of the car and see the nice lines that it has.  Still - good work.', '2007-12-12 17:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311586, 621067, 67152, '<td valign="top">Pretty car.  I am not sold on the angle or the significant amount of sky present.  A higher angle to show off more of the vehicle might have really been cool - maybe by getting up on a step ladder or something.</td>', 'Pretty car.  I am not sold on the angle or the significant amount of sky present.  A higher angle to show off more of the vehicle might have really been cool - maybe by getting up on a step ladder or something.', '2007-12-12 17:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
