(4311621, 621008, 67152, '<td valign="top">Really awesome car.  I wish the image was taken from a higher angle so we could get a better look at the car.  In addition, there seems to be a bit too much sky in the image - I want to see the car!!!</td>', 'Really awesome car.  I wish the image was taken from a higher angle so we could get a better look at the car.  In addition, there seems to be a bit too much sky in the image - I want to see the car!!!', '2007-12-12 17:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311624, 621092, 67152, '<td valign="top">Nice use of B/W.  The starbursts from the lamps adds a nice touch as well.  I am just not sure about the placement of the vehicle.  It just seems too far to the right.</td>', 'Nice use of B/W.  The starbursts from the lamps adds a nice touch as well.  I am just not sure about the placement of the vehicle.  It just seems too far to the right.', '2007-12-12 17:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311631, 620823, 71526, '<td valign="top">I like your simetric composition here, the V sign symbolizes the line "V for Victory" which I think it is great for a car ad.</td>', 'I like your simetric composition here, the V sign symbolizes the line "V for Victory" which I think it is great for a car ad.', '2007-12-12 17:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311634, 621069, 71526, '<td valign="top">I like the extreme angle and love the clouds! Great PP!</td>', 'I like the extreme angle and love the clouds! Great PP!', '2007-12-12 17:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311637, 620977, 71526, '<td valign="top">You present a great concept for a car ad here, perfectly matched with your title. Great angle!<br/> <br/>I can see you did not cloned out those branches in the front glass of the car, perhaps trying to break symmetry and/or adding some drama?</td>', 'You present a great concept for a car ad here, perfectly matched with your title. Great angle! I can see you did not cloned out those branches in the front glass of the car, perhaps trying to break symmetry and/or adding some drama?', '2007-12-12 17:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311683, 620823, 66784, '<td valign="top">It''s one of the few photos in this challenge that really looks like a proper car ad, instead of a generic car shot. Could easily be in a car magazine. Well done!</td>', 'It''s one of the few photos in this challenge that really looks like a proper car ad, instead of a generic car shot. Could easily be in a car magazine. Well done!', '2007-12-12 18:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311687, 620618, 66784, '<td valign="top">Great composition, has that combination of imagination, travel and realism that good car adds usually have. Congratulations.</td>', 'Great composition, has that combination of imagination, travel and realism that good car adds usually have. Congratulations.', '2007-12-12 18:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311695, 620744, 66784, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition, really like the shadows!</td>', 'Excellent composition, really like the shadows!', '2007-12-12 18:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311707, 620925, 67152, '<td valign="top">Really nice lines and perspective on this shot - what a great brand image.  The water is a nice touch.  I just wish the Cat was a bit sharper and a bit more glossy looking</td>', 'Really nice lines and perspective on this shot - what a great brand image.  The water is a nice touch.  I just wish the Cat was a bit sharper and a bit more glossy looking', '2007-12-12 18:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311712, 621094, 67152, '<td valign="top">Love the crazy over the top processing here. The heavy burning really works well to give this an almost ''Knight-rider'' feel...7</td>', 'Love the crazy over the top processing here. The heavy burning really works well to give this an almost ''Knight-rider'' feel...7', '2007-12-12 18:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311713, 620831, 67152, '<td valign="top">Good use of perspective and background to provide a strong and dramatic effect.  I just think a bit more of the front of the beast would have really been nice- these things have great grills - let''s see it!</td>', 'Good use of perspective and background to provide a strong and dramatic effect.  I just think a bit more of the front of the beast would have really been nice- these things have great grills - let''s see it!', '2007-12-12 18:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311716, 620868, 67152, '<td valign="top">i like the lines created by the wheels, the door panels, the windows, and the scaffold in the background.  It pulls me in.  However, the image seems a bit too blurry (probably the intent) but it does not work for me here.</td>', 'i like the lines created by the wheels, the door panels, the windows, and the scaffold in the background.  It pulls me in.  However, the image seems a bit too blurry (probably the intent) but it does not work for me here.', '2007-12-12 18:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311717, 620931, 67152, '<td valign="top">Excellent brochure insert.  Realistic auto ad.  The placement of the tree works really well to balance the image - but I just wish it wasn''t a sappling that is being helpd up by a stick  - "Are you telling me something about the car?  Does it have flaws too?"  All in all - really good work</td>', 'Excellent brochure insert.  Realistic auto ad.  The placement of the tree works really well to balance the image - but I just wish it wasn''t a sappling that is being helpd up by a stick  - "Are you telling me something about the car?  Does it have flaws too?"  All in all - really good work', '2007-12-12 18:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311718, 620838, 67152, '<td valign="top">Excellent showroom shot.  Nice and shiny - good perspective and angle - excellent lines and great lighting.</td>', 'Excellent showroom shot.  Nice and shiny - good perspective and angle - excellent lines and great lighting.', '2007-12-12 18:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311720, 620977, 67152, '<td valign="top">Excellent stuff - very edgy, dramatic, and the brand just seems to shine.  I only wish the reflection of the tree on the hood wasn''t there - a bit of distraction and costs you a single point...9</td>', 'Excellent stuff - very edgy, dramatic, and the brand just seems to shine.  I only wish the reflection of the tree on the hood wasn''t there - a bit of distraction and costs you a single point...9', '2007-12-12 18:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311723, 620917, 67152, '<td valign="top">Good perspective shot - and the lighting on the front of the truck is really good - but the front side panel could use a bit better lighting.  Overall, a good auto ad.</td>', 'Good perspective shot - and the lighting on the front of the truck is really good - but the front side panel could use a bit better lighting.  Overall, a good auto ad.', '2007-12-12 18:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311727, 620041, 67152, '<td valign="top">Nice concept.  Really beautiful car - that grill is just killer!   I am not convinced about the snow on the car - the concept may have worked better with a clean car on a blanket of snow to show how it is defying the elements.</td>', 'Nice concept.  Really beautiful car - that grill is just killer!   I am not convinced about the snow on the car - the concept may have worked better with a clean car on a blanket of snow to show how it is defying the elements.', '2007-12-12 18:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311743, 621091, 67152, '<td valign="top">Very cool perspective and good use of low key.  The crop is pretty cool as well.</td>', 'Very cool perspective and good use of low key.  The crop is pretty cool as well.', '2007-12-12 18:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311747, 621125, 67152, '<td valign="top">I love the lines that a created by street lights in shots like this.   I am just not sure it really works great for me as an advertisement.  It''s technically good - especially with the lighting on the driving wheel and Ford sign - so it gets a 7</td>', 'I love the lines that a created by street lights in shots like this.   I am just not sure it really works great for me as an advertisement.  It''s technically good - especially with the lighting on the driving wheel and Ford sign - so it gets a 7', '2007-12-12 18:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311748, 620908, 67152, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition - love the placement of the ''other'' Shelby in the upper right.  It clearly looks like a well crafted advert for this modern muscle car.</td>', 'Excellent composition - love the placement of the ''other'' Shelby in the upper right.  It clearly looks like a well crafted advert for this modern muscle car.', '2007-12-12 18:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311752, 621002, 67152, '<td valign="top">Really good auto ad!  A traditional set up, excellent angle on the truck (and an extremely clean one at that!), and really good background.</td>', 'Really good auto ad!  A traditional set up, excellent angle on the truck (and an extremely clean one at that!), and really good background.', '2007-12-12 19:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311755, 620568, 67152, '<td valign="top">Cool perspective shot on the ''Kruzer'' - I am just really not sold on the background - the sky and red background do more to distract me than anything else.</td>', 'Cool perspective shot on the ''Kruzer'' - I am just really not sold on the background - the sky and red background do more to distract me than anything else.', '2007-12-12 19:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311761, 620989, 67152, '<td valign="top">You aren''t kidding about that...It looks like someone got some pretty good use out of it though!   i''m not crazy about the processing - a bit too ''gray'' for my taste (i like contrasty stuff), but i guess is fits the theme of the shot pretty well here</td>', 'You aren''t kidding about that...It looks like someone got some pretty good use out of it though!   i''m not crazy about the processing - a bit too ''gray'' for my taste (i like contrasty stuff), but i guess is fits the theme of the shot pretty well here', '2007-12-12 19:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311762, 620202, 67152, '<td valign="top">I love the feel created by the colors and processing.  It almost has the feel of a Christmas Tree lot with the greens and reds and blues throughout the image.</td>', 'I love the feel created by the colors and processing.  It almost has the feel of a Christmas Tree lot with the greens and reds and blues throughout the image.', '2007-12-12 19:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311765, 621051, 67152, '<td valign="top">Excellent stuff - the stop action on the Porsche is spot on and the movement in the trees as this little gem tears up the pavement works really well.</td>', 'Excellent stuff - the stop action on the Porsche is spot on and the movement in the trees as this little gem tears up the pavement works really well.', '2007-12-12 19:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311771, 620683, 67152, '<td valign="top">Really cool idea - the bow is a nice touch.  However, I am really not sold on the crop and angle.  The grill and headlights of Mercedes are so dramatic, by cutting them off, I feel we are missing a lot of the beauty of the car.  In addition, there is a lot of ''blank space'' on the hood of the car where we see a pretty unattractive ceiling.</td>', 'Really cool idea - the bow is a nice touch.  However, I am really not sold on the crop and angle.  The grill and headlights of Mercedes are so dramatic, by cutting them off, I feel we are missing a lot of the beauty of the car.  In addition, there is a lot of ''blank space'' on the hood of the car where we see a pretty unattractive ceiling.', '2007-12-12 19:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311773, 620538, 67152, '<td valign="top">This is one cool car - i just wish the image were a lot bigger to maximize the details we see.  You have captured some wonderful textures and smoothness, but I feel that I am longing for much more and 640 pixels would really allowed that...</td>', 'This is one cool car - i just wish the image were a lot bigger to maximize the details we see.  You have captured some wonderful textures and smoothness, but I feel that I am longing for much more and 640 pixels would really allowed that...', '2007-12-12 19:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311774, 620002, 67152, '<td valign="top">Funny ad!  The sneer is a nice touch.  Gotta say, I think it might actually work as a humorous ad for the right magazine.  <br/> <br/>I am sure you are getting killed by the "it''s a toy" crowd - but I think it''s creative and well delivered. 7</td>', 'Funny ad!  The sneer is a nice touch.  Gotta say, I think it might actually work as a humorous ad for the right magazine.   I am sure you are getting killed by the "it''s a toy" crowd - but I think it''s creative and well delivered. 7', '2007-12-12 19:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311776, 620754, 67152, '<td valign="top">Good perspective shot - the center crop sells stability and ruggedness to the audience.  I think blacking out the windows even more would have even helped this a bit more.</td>', 'Good perspective shot - the center crop sells stability and ruggedness to the audience.  I think blacking out the windows even more would have even helped this a bit more.', '2007-12-12 19:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311777, 620520, 67152, '<td valign="top">I love this - very creative ad - Makes me want to go to the showroom.</td>', 'I love this - very creative ad - Makes me want to go to the showroom.', '2007-12-12 19:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311780, 620282, 67152, '<td valign="top">This really could be from a Honda Ad.  The background really complements the car, the lights are a nice touch, and the angle is spot on.  It does not have a great deal of inventiveness in the shot (I have seen this on many a car brochure) but it is well delivered so it gets an 8</td>', 'This really could be from a Honda Ad.  The background really complements the car, the lights are a nice touch, and the angle is spot on.  It does not have a great deal of inventiveness in the shot (I have seen this on many a car brochure) but it is well delivered so it gets an 8', '2007-12-12 19:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311783, 620861, 67152, '<td valign="top">Ferrari is a great brand - so flashy and beautiful.  I am just not sure about the ''flames'' or ''smoke'' or whatever it is that is clouding the toy.</td>', 'Ferrari is a great brand - so flashy and beautiful.  I am just not sure about the ''flames'' or ''smoke'' or whatever it is that is clouding the toy.', '2007-12-12 19:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311793, 621081, 67152, '<td valign="top">I like the background a lot - really modern, with good lines and contrast.  The only thing is that it seems to overwhelm the car a bit.  The choice of lens is good for the background but it seems to distort the car a bit.  In addition, the reflection off the hood and window seems to break up the lines of the car and makes it look smaller and less attractive.  The car should be the center piece - and I just don''t think it comes across as well as it might.  Still, a good and solid image.</td>', 'I like the background a lot - really modern, with good lines and contrast.  The only thing is that it seems to overwhelm the car a bit.  The choice of lens is good for the background but it seems to distort the car a bit.  In addition, the reflection off the hood and window seems to break up the lines of the car and makes it look smaller and less attractive.  The car should be the center piece - and I just don''t think it comes across as well as it might.  Still, a good and solid image.', '2007-12-12 19:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311794, 621074, 67152, '<td valign="top">I like the title and the action shot for an ad for Hummer.  I just think a closeup of the vehicle going through the water would have really made for a more dramatic shot and a better ad</td>', 'I like the title and the action shot for an ad for Hummer.  I just think a closeup of the vehicle going through the water would have really made for a more dramatic shot and a better ad', '2007-12-12 19:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311796, 621077, 67152, '<td valign="top">Beautiful car and beatuifully captured.  The colors and tones provide such a nostalgic feel.  Spot on!</td>', 'Beautiful car and beatuifully captured.  The colors and tones provide such a nostalgic feel.  Spot on!', '2007-12-12 19:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311799, 620946, 67152, '<td valign="top">Really nice title - it really has a strong message.  The image itself could use some better lighting.  The car is too dark and the side of the car is in full shadows.  Shooting this from the other angle would provide better natural light.</td>', 'Really nice title - it really has a strong message.  The image itself could use some better lighting.  The car is too dark and the side of the car is in full shadows.  Shooting this from the other angle would provide better natural light.', '2007-12-12 19:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311802, 620666, 67152, '<td valign="top">nicely composed image - very cool use of reflection and really solid focus</td>', 'nicely composed image - very cool use of reflection and really solid focus', '2007-12-12 19:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4311809, 620283, 67152, '<td valign="top">Excellent photograph - the tones and textures are outstanding - telling a story by themselves of desperation and loss and violence.  I just feel that this is too much of a stretch to get to a car ad - maybe a public service announcement, but not an ad.</td>', 'Excellent photograph - the tones and textures are outstanding - telling a story by themselves of desperation and loss and violence.  I just feel that this is too much of a stretch to get to a car ad - maybe a public service announcement, but not an ad.', '2007-12-12 19:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
