(4313882, 621081, 27133, '<td valign="top">Very nice indeed.</td>', 'Very nice indeed.', '2007-12-13 22:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4313883, 620666, 68972, '<td valign="top">Highlights in all the dark places - well done.</td>', 'Highlights in all the dark places - well done.', '2007-12-13 22:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4313884, 620754, 68972, '<td valign="top">Personally, the grill and emblem are mesmerizing - the top half of the image is distracting to me.  Nice light on the grill and emblem.</td>', 'Personally, the grill and emblem are mesmerizing - the top half of the image is distracting to me.  Nice light on the grill and emblem.', '2007-12-13 22:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4313885, 620921, 27133, '<td valign="top">This would have to be in the top 3!</td>', 'This would have to be in the top 3!', '2007-12-13 22:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4313886, 620908, 27133, '<td valign="top">The winner!</td>', 'The winner!', '2007-12-13 22:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4313887, 621125, 68972, '<td valign="top">Shows excitement and highlights the emblem.  Well done!</td>', 'Shows excitement and highlights the emblem.  Well done!', '2007-12-13 22:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4313888, 621106, 27133, '<td valign="top">Definitely a ribbon holder!</td>', 'Definitely a ribbon holder!', '2007-12-13 22:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4313891, 620946, 68972, '<td valign="top">The side of the car needs a big white reflector bouncing light into it - in my opinion.  Nice job leavingt the parking lights on.</td>', 'The side of the car needs a big white reflector bouncing light into it - in my opinion.  Nice job leavingt the parking lights on.', '2007-12-13 22:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4313894, 621008, 68972, '<td valign="top">Great image!  A reflector on the grill and lights would be awesome to highlight all that chrome.</td>', 'Great image!  A reflector on the grill and lights would be awesome to highlight all that chrome.', '2007-12-13 22:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4313898, 620282, 68972, '<td valign="top">Awesome ad shot.</td>', 'Awesome ad shot.', '2007-12-13 22:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4313903, 620838, 68972, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I think the photographer in the image is distracting though.  Kinda funny.</td>', 'Great shot.  I think the photographer in the image is distracting though.  Kinda funny.', '2007-12-13 22:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4313906, 621106, 68972, '<td valign="top">Incredible light.  Very well done!</td>', 'Incredible light.  Very well done!', '2007-12-13 22:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4313944, 621009, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice clean image!</td>', 'Nice clean image!', '2007-12-13 23:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4313945, 621094, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic processing.  I like how it accentuates the curves of the car.</td>', 'Very dramatic processing.  I like how it accentuates the curves of the car.', '2007-12-13 23:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4313947, 621077, 35513, '<td valign="top">Beautiful car!!  Loves the soft nostalgic tones of this shot.  I might suggest cropping a bit off the top of the photo, cause I''m not sure it''s necessary.  But nice job!!</td>', 'Beautiful car!!  Loves the soft nostalgic tones of this shot.  I might suggest cropping a bit off the top of the photo, cause I''m not sure it''s necessary.  But nice job!!', '2007-12-13 23:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4313950, 620568, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very interesting processing.  It certainly makes the car stand out, but I find the red to be a bit distracting.</td>', 'Very interesting processing.  It certainly makes the car stand out, but I find the red to be a bit distracting.', '2007-12-13 23:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4313953, 621054, 35513, '<td valign="top">Love the reflections in the chrome, but I think for an "ad" I''d like to see more of the car.  Especially a classic like this one!</td>', 'Love the reflections in the chrome, but I think for an "ad" I''d like to see more of the car.  Especially a classic like this one!', '2007-12-13 23:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4313957, 620666, 35513, '<td valign="top">Classic ad shot :-)  Is this a model car?? ;-)  Great  lighting and I love the reflection of the car on the surface of the ground.</td>', 'Classic ad shot :-)  Is this a model car?? ;-)  Great  lighting and I love the reflection of the car on the surface of the ground.', '2007-12-13 23:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4313958, 620677, 35513, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s one angry wife!</td>', 'Wow, that''s one angry wife!', '2007-12-13 23:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4313960, 620908, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed for an ad!</td>', 'Nicely composed for an ad!', '2007-12-13 23:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4313967, 621047, 35513, '<td valign="top">Man, wouldn''t I love to see that in my driveway christmas morning!!</td>', 'Man, wouldn''t I love to see that in my driveway christmas morning!!', '2007-12-13 23:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4313970, 621128, 35513, '<td valign="top">Makes for an interesting abstract, though I''m not sure it shouts "ad" to me.</td>', 'Makes for an interesting abstract, though I''m not sure it shouts "ad" to me.', '2007-12-13 23:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4313975, 620785, 35513, '<td valign="top">I like the use of DOF on this shot....gives a sense of motion, even though the car is still.  Kinda jumps in your face.</td>', 'I like the use of DOF on this shot....gives a sense of motion, even though the car is still.  Kinda jumps in your face.', '2007-12-13 23:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4313976, 621067, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very nice sharp image of the car!  And I like the natural surroundings as well.</td>', 'Very nice sharp image of the car!  And I like the natural surroundings as well.', '2007-12-13 23:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4313977, 620881, 35513, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot and lovely image for an ad!</td>', 'Beautiful shot and lovely image for an ad!', '2007-12-13 23:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4313978, 621051, 35513, '<td valign="top">GREAT capture!  Must have been tough to get, but you did a great job!</td>', 'GREAT capture!  Must have been tough to get, but you did a great job!', '2007-12-13 23:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4313979, 620931, 35513, '<td valign="top">Great sky, great job with a nice clean, sharp looking car.  Well done!</td>', 'Great sky, great job with a nice clean, sharp looking car.  Well done!', '2007-12-13 23:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4313980, 620618, 35513, '<td valign="top">Great photo, especially for this kind of car!</td>', 'Great photo, especially for this kind of car!', '2007-12-13 23:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4313984, 620704, 35513, '<td valign="top">*sigh* oh, to have an RX-8.....lovely car!</td>', '*sigh* oh, to have an RX-8.....lovely car!', '2007-12-13 23:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4313985, 621106, 35513, '<td valign="top">Great angle on a beautiful classic car!</td>', 'Great angle on a beautiful classic car!', '2007-12-13 23:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4313986, 621069, 35513, '<td valign="top">Wow, this shot has some serious impact!  Only nitpick is that I''d like to see a *little* more of the top of the car.  But I LOVE the angle here!</td>', 'Wow, this shot has some serious impact!  Only nitpick is that I''d like to see a *little* more of the top of the car.  But I LOVE the angle here!', '2007-12-13 23:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4313988, 620283, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very moody picture of the car, and overall I like it as an image--but I''m not sure I can really think of it as a car ad.</td>', 'Very moody picture of the car, and overall I like it as an image--but I''m not sure I can really think of it as a car ad.', '2007-12-13 23:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4313996, 621009, 70270, '<td valign="top">Cool car.  Nice focus on the hood, but the shallow DOF and cropped back hurts this one for me, especially the 8 cut off at the right edge.  5</td>', 'Cool car.  Nice focus on the hood, but the shallow DOF and cropped back hurts this one for me, especially the 8 cut off at the right edge.  5', '2007-12-13 23:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4313997, 620785, 70270, '<td valign="top">The shallow DOF hurts this one for me.  I''d rather see the whole car in focus.  5</td>', 'The shallow DOF hurts this one for me.  I''d rather see the whole car in focus.  5', '2007-12-13 23:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4313998, 620945, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice snapshot of a car for sale, but nothing here pulls this out of the ordinary.  Just a 5 from me.</td>', 'Nice snapshot of a car for sale, but nothing here pulls this out of the ordinary.  Just a 5 from me.', '2007-12-13 23:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4313999, 621054, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice old car.  As a car ad, though, I''d rather see more of the car, and the very many reflections off the hood and the bumper are too distracting for me.  5</td>', 'Nice old car.  As a car ad, though, I''d rather see more of the car, and the very many reflections off the hood and the bumper are too distracting for me.  5', '2007-12-13 23:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4314000, 621094, 70270, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo.  Processing is a bit over the top, and loses too much detail on the car.  I might give this a 6 in another challenge, but as a car ad its just a 5 from me.</td>', 'Interesting photo.  Processing is a bit over the top, and loses too much detail on the car.  I might give this a 6 in another challenge, but as a car ad its just a 5 from me.', '2007-12-13 23:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4314001, 621092, 70270, '<td valign="top">I think this might have worked better with teh truck heading towards the lights rather than out of the frame.  The trees and the car compete too much for my attention here.  5</td>', 'I think this might have worked better with teh truck heading towards the lights rather than out of the frame.  The trees and the car compete too much for my attention here.  5', '2007-12-13 23:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4314002, 620823, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp shot, but not much visual interest in the subject and the colors are a little flat.  5</td>', 'Nice sharp shot, but not much visual interest in the subject and the colors are a little flat.  5', '2007-12-13 23:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4314003, 621128, 70270, '<td valign="top">Too many confusing lines and reflections here; doesn''t really do anything for me.  Sorry.  4</td>', 'Too many confusing lines and reflections here; doesn''t really do anything for me.  Sorry.  4', '2007-12-13 23:54:35.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4314004, 621027, 70270, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, but too overprocessed for my taste.  Just a 4 from me</td>', 'Interesting shot, but too overprocessed for my taste.  Just a 4 from me', '2007-12-13 23:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4314006, 620704, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice car, but not much more than a snapshot, the glare on the hood and roof and the reflections on the window and hood detract from the image, and the background doesn''t do anything to improve the shot.  4</td>', 'Nice car, but not much more than a snapshot, the glare on the hood and roof and the reflections on the window and hood detract from the image, and the background doesn''t do anything to improve the shot.  4', '2007-12-13 23:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4314008, 620002, 80904, '<td valign="top">That elf looks mean. LoL</td>', 'That elf looks mean. LoL', '2007-12-14 00:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4314067, 621048, 54882, '<td valign="top">Curious as to what has caused that effect with the front tyre.<br/>Still it says the picture has been validated so i guess its just a bizarre camera effect.</td>', 'Curious as to what has caused that effect with the front tyre.Still it says the picture has been validated so i guess its just a bizarre camera effect.', '2007-12-14 01:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4314069, 620889, 54882, '<td valign="top">Nice moody picture.</td>', 'Nice moody picture.', '2007-12-14 01:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4314138, 620202, 31637, '<td valign="top">Id buy that white one for sure.</td>', 'Id buy that white one for sure.', '2007-12-14 03:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4314184, 620925, 65035, '<td valign="top">Love the reflection and that gorgeous red.</td>', 'Love the reflection and that gorgeous red.', '2007-12-14 05:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4314185, 621105, 65035, '<td valign="top">Wow what a beast, beautifully photographed.</td>', 'Wow what a beast, beautifully photographed.', '2007-12-14 05:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4314190, 620283, 65035, '<td valign="top">An interesting take on the challenge and a very funky angle...they''re good things btw.</td>', 'An interesting take on the challenge and a very funky angle...they''re good things btw.', '2007-12-14 05:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4314191, 621087, 65035, '<td valign="top">Perfect, Prius should buy this one of you.</td>', 'Perfect, Prius should buy this one of you.', '2007-12-14 05:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4314192, 621047, 65035, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Random useless fact alert... Rolls Royce''s never break down, they occasionally "fail to proceed" but they never break down.</td>', 'Nice shot. Random useless fact alert... Rolls Royce''s never break down, they occasionally "fail to proceed" but they never break down.', '2007-12-14 05:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4314193, 620520, 65035, '<td valign="top">Ooooo I like sparkly things. This is a very cool shot.</td>', 'Ooooo I like sparkly things. This is a very cool shot.', '2007-12-14 05:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4314194, 621106, 65035, '<td valign="top">That''s a very purty car, does it come with the cute man? Stunning background too.</td>', 'That''s a very purty car, does it come with the cute man? Stunning background too.', '2007-12-14 05:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4314197, 620908, 65035, '<td valign="top">Stunning image.</td>', 'Stunning image.', '2007-12-14 05:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4314199, 621094, 65035, '<td valign="top">Great car and great angle but something isn''t grabbing me, I think it''s the selective desat, there are distracting blotches of colour that draw my eye away from the car.</td>', 'Great car and great angle but something isn''t grabbing me, I think it''s the selective desat, there are distracting blotches of colour that draw my eye away from the car.', '2007-12-14 05:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4314206, 621087, 12674, '<td valign="top">Very effective, and appropriately colored green...</td>', 'Very effective, and appropriately colored green...', '2007-12-14 06:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4314405, 620989, 70270, '<td valign="top">Good subject, but there''s no clear focal point on the car that grabs my attention. Think this would have worked well as a close in detail shot or further away to take in more of the car, but this mid-range composition just doesn''t do it for me.  Sorry. 3</td>', 'Good subject, but there''s no clear focal point on the car that grabs my attention. Think this would have worked well as a close in detail shot or further away to take in more of the car, but this mid-range composition just doesn''t do it for me.  Sorry. 3', '2007-12-14 09:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4314406, 620202, 70270, '<td valign="top">OK shot, but comes across as a snapshot to me ... this one is all about the processing.  4</td>', 'OK shot, but comes across as a snapshot to me ... this one is all about the processing.  4', '2007-12-14 09:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4314407, 620744, 70270, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but falls down for me on several levels.  If the focus is on the crowd noticing the truck, they need to be more in focus imo.  If its the truck, you need more of the truck in the shot.  Has an intersting brownie camera kind of feel for me, but as a car ad its just a 4.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but falls down for me on several levels.  If the focus is on the crowd noticing the truck, they need to be more in focus imo.  If its the truck, you need more of the truck in the shot.  Has an intersting brownie camera kind of feel for me, but as a car ad its just a 4.', '2007-12-14 09:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4314409, 620283, 70270, '<td valign="top">A good subject for an oobie take on the challenge, but I don''t like the angle its shot from.  Lighting is nice though.  4</td>', 'A good subject for an oobie take on the challenge, but I don''t like the angle its shot from.  Lighting is nice though.  4', '2007-12-14 09:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4314411, 621047, 70270, '<td valign="top">Too much ribbon, not enough car, and the reflections in the background window are distracting.  Plus isn''t that a Bentley?  So is the car dreaming of a Rolls, or are you wishing you had shot a Rolls instead?  3</td>', 'Too much ribbon, not enough car, and the reflections in the background window are distracting.  Plus isn''t that a Bentley?  So is the car dreaming of a Rolls, or are you wishing you had shot a Rolls instead?  3', '2007-12-14 09:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4314416, 621074, 70270, '<td valign="top">OK action shot, but a little soft on focus and doesn''t do much to sell the car to me.  Maybe a three-quarters angle instead of shooting the car head on would have worked better.  4</td>', 'OK action shot, but a little soft on focus and doesn''t do much to sell the car to me.  Maybe a three-quarters angle instead of shooting the car head on would have worked better.  4', '2007-12-14 09:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4314417, 620921, 70270, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, but does more to sell the brand than the car.  Like the light on the brick wall and the car though.  5</td>', 'Interesting shot, but does more to sell the brand than the car.  Like the light on the brick wall and the car though.  5', '2007-12-14 09:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4314418, 620946, 70270, '<td valign="top">Good location for the shoot, but the focus on the car is way too soft for me, and the glare is distracting.  3</td>', 'Good location for the shoot, but the focus on the car is way too soft for me, and the glare is distracting.  3', '2007-12-14 09:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4314419, 620979, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice detail shot, but doesn''t do much for me.  4</td>', 'Nice detail shot, but doesn''t do much for me.  4', '2007-12-14 09:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4314420, 620837, 70270, '<td valign="top">Reflections on the windshields are distracting, and the background makes this look just like a snapshot.  Sorry. 4</td>', 'Reflections on the windshields are distracting, and the background makes this look just like a snapshot.  Sorry. 4', '2007-12-14 09:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4314421, 621105, 70270, '<td valign="top">Lighting is a bit harsh, and the flat two-dimensional angle doesn''t bring out the from of the car.  Just a 4 from me.</td>', 'Lighting is a bit harsh, and the flat two-dimensional angle doesn''t bring out the from of the car.  Just a 4 from me.', '2007-12-14 09:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4314424, 620754, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice motion blur and good sharp focus on the Ford logo here.  The antenna cut out at the top of the frame is a little annoying, because it draws my eye up and out of the image.  6</td>', 'Nice motion blur and good sharp focus on the Ford logo here.  The antenna cut out at the top of the frame is a little annoying, because it draws my eye up and out of the image.  6', '2007-12-14 10:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4314425, 620868, 70270, '<td valign="top">Just a snapshot that doesn''t say anything to me about the cars.  Cutting the front of the first one in the row out brings this down, as does the scaffolding in the background.  Maybe shot from a little more to the left in front of the car would have worked better.  4</td>', 'Just a snapshot that doesn''t say anything to me about the cars.  Cutting the front of the first one in the row out brings this down, as does the scaffolding in the background.  Maybe shot from a little more to the left in front of the car would have worked better.  4', '2007-12-14 10:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4314432, 620348, 70270, '<td valign="top">OK .. I''m grading this challenge on a curve, and this was one of the few 3s I gave out.  It probably should be a 4, maybe even a 5, because the lighting on the car is nice.  But the guardrail in the front is very distracting, and with the door open on the other side of the car it looks like we''re missing out on too much.  So why is it a 3?  Because it is, hands down, the best looking car in the challenge, and there is so much more that could have been done with such a wonderful subject, imo.  OK, maybe that''s not fair.  4.</td>', 'OK .. I''m grading this challenge on a curve, and this was one of the few 3s I gave out.  It probably should be a 4, maybe even a 5, because the lighting on the car is nice.  But the guardrail in the front is very distracting, and with the door open on the other side of the car it looks like we''re missing out on too much.  So why is it a 3?  Because it is, hands down, the best looking car in the challenge, and there is so much more that could have been done with such a wonderful subject, imo.  OK, maybe that''s not fair.  4.', '2007-12-14 10:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4314433, 621091, 70270, '<td valign="top">The lighting is too harsh, and the angle does nothing for me.  I''d like to see more of this old beater before laying out a C-note for it!  3.</td>', 'The lighting is too harsh, and the angle does nothing for me.  I''d like to see more of this old beater before laying out a C-note for it!  3.', '2007-12-14 10:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4314435, 620683, 70270, '<td valign="top">Angle is too confusing, not sure which car we''re looking at, and both the reflections on the hood and the bright plastic bow detract from the image imo. 3</td>', 'Angle is too confusing, not sure which car we''re looking at, and both the reflections on the hood and the bright plastic bow detract from the image imo. 3', '2007-12-14 10:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4314438, 620677, 70270, '<td valign="top">Humor - 10.  Photo - 1.  Challenge - 3.</td>', 'Humor - 10.  Photo - 1.  Challenge - 3.', '2007-12-14 10:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4314488, 621047, 79128, '<td valign="top">Uh? Looks like its a Bentley and not a Rolls. Tha fact that there is a glass between you and the subject takes away from the picture of the car. Nice try.</td>', 'Uh? Looks like its a Bentley and not a Rolls. Tha fact that there is a glass between you and the subject takes away from the picture of the car. Nice try.', '2007-12-14 10:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
