(4315381, 620881, 68454, '<td valign="top">Love the car.  IMHO, would''ve liked a higher vantage, and less sky reflection on the car.  I would''ve preferred some motion blur also.  As is, the scene looks too static, like the car is parked on the road, vs. what I expect from a Porsche, which is exquisite movement.  Good luck.</td>', 'Love the car.  IMHO, would''ve liked a higher vantage, and less sky reflection on the car.  I would''ve preferred some motion blur also.  As is, the scene looks too static, like the car is parked on the road, vs. what I expect from a Porsche, which is exquisite movement.  Good luck.', '2007-12-14 21:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4315382, 621051, 68454, '<td valign="top">Nice!!  I love Porsche ever since owning a 944.  I wish there was more even lighting on the car itself, but other than that, very nice motion blur.  Conveys speed quite nicely.</td>', 'Nice!!  I love Porsche ever since owning a 944.  I wish there was more even lighting on the car itself, but other than that, very nice motion blur.  Conveys speed quite nicely.', '2007-12-14 21:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
