(4315421, 621081, 68454, '<td valign="top">Overall, very nice.  I can''t explain why, but it seems the front wheels should be turned the other direction.  Don''t know why.  I also wish there weren''t such strong reflections on the roof and windshield, but I think the lack of traffic is great.  Good luck.</td>', 'Overall, very nice.  I can''t explain why, but it seems the front wheels should be turned the other direction.  Don''t know why.  I also wish there weren''t such strong reflections on the roof and windshield, but I think the lack of traffic is great.  Good luck.', '2007-12-14 22:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4315423, 620785, 68454, '<td valign="top">Nice selective focus.  Looks too much like a model to me though.</td>', 'Nice selective focus.  Looks too much like a model to me though.', '2007-12-14 22:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4315426, 620282, 68454, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Nice comp. and DOF.  I just wish the lamps weren''t blown.</td>', 'Very nice.  Nice comp. and DOF.  I just wish the lamps weren''t blown.', '2007-12-14 22:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4315442, 621092, 38930, '<td valign="top">One of the better shots I''ve seen so far.  I would have like to seen, though, separation from the car and rails.  Also, the license plate looks fake.  Maybe use the ''blur'' tool next time rather than painting over it.<br/>Great job tho.</td>', 'One of the better shots I''ve seen so far.  I would have like to seen, though, separation from the car and rails.  Also, the license plate looks fake.  Maybe use the ''blur'' tool next time rather than painting over it.Great job tho.', '2007-12-14 22:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4315444, 620202, 38930, '<td valign="top">The camera is worth more than all those cars combined!</td>', 'The camera is worth more than all those cars combined!', '2007-12-14 22:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4315446, 621087, 38930, '<td valign="top">nice concept</td>', 'nice concept', '2007-12-14 22:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4315454, 620831, 38930, '<td valign="top">I see a ribbon with your name on it!  (if I knew your name...)<br/>One minor thing...I would have like to seen you turn the steering wheel to the left so the front tires are pointing more towards the camera.  Overall, awesome.</td>', 'I see a ribbon with your name on it!  (if I knew your name...)One minor thing...I would have like to seen you turn the steering wheel to the left so the front tires are pointing more towards the camera.  Overall, awesome.', '2007-12-14 22:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4315457, 620908, 38930, '<td valign="top">This is thinking outside the box...very nice</td>', 'This is thinking outside the box...very nice', '2007-12-14 22:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4315458, 620837, 38930, '<td valign="top">If I give you a high vote will you give me one of these?</td>', 'If I give you a high vote will you give me one of these?', '2007-12-14 22:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4315460, 620917, 38930, '<td valign="top">Not exactly a vehicle that would be shown in an Ad nowadays, but you did a lot better lighting this than most people in this challenge.  Makes it look like a nice truck</td>', 'Not exactly a vehicle that would be shown in an Ad nowadays, but you did a lot better lighting this than most people in this challenge.  Makes it look like a nice truck', '2007-12-14 22:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4315467, 620881, 10643, '<td valign="top">Totally my favorite so far. Love the blue glimpse in the sky.</td>', 'Totally my favorite so far. Love the blue glimpse in the sky.', '2007-12-14 23:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4315468, 620538, 10643, '<td valign="top">Great color, love those old grilles, wish it was bigger</td>', 'Great color, love those old grilles, wish it was bigger', '2007-12-14 23:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4315613, 621081, 83650, '<td valign="top">Nice.</td>', 'Nice.', '2007-12-15 04:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4315628, 620921, 49109, '<td valign="top">just a hint more of the car and this would have been perfect</td>', 'just a hint more of the car and this would have been perfect', '2007-12-15 04:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4315629, 620831, 49109, '<td valign="top">very good POV and choice of lens. could be a tad brighter. still one of my top picks.</td>', 'very good POV and choice of lens. could be a tad brighter. still one of my top picks.', '2007-12-15 04:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4315679, 620041, 76039, '<td valign="top">i like this photo in black ''n'' white</td>', 'i like this photo in black ''n'' white', '2007-12-15 08:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4315681, 621125, 76039, '<td valign="top">i love the colourful lights</td>', 'i love the colourful lights', '2007-12-15 08:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4315683, 621010, 76039, '<td valign="top">i like th photo but its a bit blury</td>', 'i like th photo but its a bit blury', '2007-12-15 08:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4315684, 621081, 76039, '<td valign="top">the angle is wierd, i like it</td>', 'the angle is wierd, i like it', '2007-12-15 08:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4315685, 620704, 76039, '<td valign="top">cool but a bit plain</td>', 'cool but a bit plain', '2007-12-15 08:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4315687, 621054, 76039, '<td valign="top">i like the car and the photo</td>', 'i like the car and the photo', '2007-12-15 08:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4315688, 620123, 76039, '<td valign="top">the photo is good but im not sure about the colours</td>', 'the photo is good but im not sure about the colours', '2007-12-15 08:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4315693, 620881, 11854, '<td valign="top">Nice processing! Love the title! Reminds me of REO Speedwagon. One of the best in the bunch. 10</td>', 'Nice processing! Love the title! Reminds me of REO Speedwagon. One of the best in the bunch. 10', '2007-12-15 09:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4315694, 621008, 11854, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the title too much, but everything else is perfect. 10</td>', 'I don''t like the title too much, but everything else is perfect. 10', '2007-12-15 09:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4315697, 621051, 11854, '<td valign="top">Nicely done! Great blur, one of the best in the bunch. 10</td>', 'Nicely done! Great blur, one of the best in the bunch. 10', '2007-12-15 09:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4315699, 620348, 11854, '<td valign="top">I wish that guardrail wasn''t there, but everything else about the photo is fantastic.</td>', 'I wish that guardrail wasn''t there, but everything else about the photo is fantastic.', '2007-12-15 09:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4315700, 621106, 11854, '<td valign="top">Love how the guy has a 50''s style to go with the 60''s car. I''d love to have one of these! Fab location!</td>', 'Love how the guy has a 50''s style to go with the 60''s car. I''d love to have one of these! Fab location!', '2007-12-15 09:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4315812, 620881, 79720, '<td valign="top">This will probably be a ribbon for you. Love the dodge n'' burn.</td>', 'This will probably be a ribbon for you. Love the dodge n'' burn.', '2007-12-15 10:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4315813, 620931, 79720, '<td valign="top">Front page. I''ll reckon.</td>', 'Front page. I''ll reckon.', '2007-12-15 10:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4316107, 620831, 79838, '<td valign="top">Very nice landscape, very well lightning. Nice picture.</td>', 'Very nice landscape, very well lightning. Nice picture.', '2007-12-15 14:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4316108, 620881, 79838, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture !!</td>', 'Excellent picture !!', '2007-12-15 14:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4316110, 621051, 79838, '<td valign="top">I can feel the speed, very well taken picture.</td>', 'I can feel the speed, very well taken picture.', '2007-12-15 14:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4316269, 621087, 80859, '<td valign="top">That says it all /10</td>', 'That says it all /10', '2007-12-15 17:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4316370, 621048, 66384, '<td valign="top">Tire looks flat. It must be the puddle. The gausian blur seems quite obvious -- there is a sort of ghosting all around the car. Still it is a good ad.</td>', 'Tire looks flat. It must be the puddle. The gausian blur seems quite obvious -- there is a sort of ghosting all around the car. Still it is a good ad.', '2007-12-15 19:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4316371, 620683, 66384, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see more of the car.</td>', 'I''d like to see more of the car.', '2007-12-15 19:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4316374, 621077, 66384, '<td valign="top">I don''t much like the color of the car and pavement, but I love the buildings in the background.</td>', 'I don''t much like the color of the car and pavement, but I love the buildings in the background.', '2007-12-15 19:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4316381, 620538, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice image. Too small to tell anything about the quality. There is a <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tutorial</a> for creating the right size with decent quality.</td>', 'Nice image. Too small to tell anything about the quality. There is a tutorial for creating the right size with decent quality.', '2007-12-15 19:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4316391, 620618, 61030, '<td valign="top">This is okay, but I have no idea what make and model this automobile is.</td>', 'This is okay, but I have no idea what make and model this automobile is.', '2007-12-15 19:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4316395, 621054, 66384, '<td valign="top">I think I like this one best. It is a beautiful image, and it really takes me back. That car was so far ahead of it''s time.<br/> <br/><i>edit for typo</i>.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-12-17 12:51:43.</i></td>', 'I think I like this one best. It is a beautiful image, and it really takes me back. That car was so far ahead of it''s time. edit for typo.', '2007-12-15 20:02:57.000000', '2007-12-17 12:51:43.000000', 1),
(4316431, 621048, 68454, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF.  The sun''s a little harsh, some parts of the car seem OOF where it doesn''t make sense for them to be, and quite frankly, the front right tire almost looks like it''s flat, vs. being in deeper water.</td>', 'Nice DOF.  The sun''s a little harsh, some parts of the car seem OOF where it doesn''t make sense for them to be, and quite frankly, the front right tire almost looks like it''s flat, vs. being in deeper water.', '2007-12-15 21:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4316432, 620837, 68454, '<td valign="top">Nice scene.  The reflections are a bit strong for my tastes.</td>', 'Nice scene.  The reflections are a bit strong for my tastes.', '2007-12-15 21:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4316434, 620041, 68454, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective.  I think the fence in the background adds quite nicely.</td>', 'Nice perspective.  I think the fence in the background adds quite nicely.', '2007-12-15 21:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4316440, 620348, 68454, '<td valign="top">Very nice car, and I like the tone choice.  The rear of the car looks a little strange to me, though.  Perhaps I''m wrong, but maybe the lens or your shooting position altered the perspective a bit.  It seems too "fat" to me.  Nice photo though.</td>', 'Very nice car, and I like the tone choice.  The rear of the car looks a little strange to me, though.  Perhaps I''m wrong, but maybe the lens or your shooting position altered the perspective a bit.  It seems too "fat" to me.  Nice photo though.', '2007-12-15 21:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4316533, 620002, 59276, '<td valign="top">Tim Jr. in training? great angle</td>', 'Tim Jr. in training? great angle', '2007-12-15 23:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4316534, 620744, 59276, '<td valign="top">I like your use of negative space</td>', 'I like your use of negative space', '2007-12-15 23:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4316536, 620538, 59276, '<td valign="top">great old car...wonderful comp and color....I''m sure your next one will be bigger</td>', 'great old car...wonderful comp and color....I''m sure your next one will be bigger', '2007-12-15 23:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4316537, 620838, 59276, '<td valign="top">wonderful comp and angle</td>', 'wonderful comp and angle', '2007-12-15 23:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4316538, 620041, 59276, '<td valign="top">oh man that looks cold...great angle</td>', 'oh man that looks cold...great angle', '2007-12-15 23:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4316540, 621094, 59276, '<td valign="top">very interesting angle and processing</td>', 'very interesting angle and processing', '2007-12-15 23:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4316542, 620889, 59276, '<td valign="top">wonderful b&amp;w....I like the coulds</td>', 'wonderful b&w....I like the coulds', '2007-12-15 23:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4316544, 620979, 59276, '<td valign="top">nice and sharpe</td>', 'nice and sharpe', '2007-12-15 23:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4316588, 620881, 31905, '<td valign="top">Awesome ... 10...if i could vote.</td>', 'Awesome ... 10...if i could vote.', '2007-12-16 00:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4316911, 621128, 68769, '<td valign="top">This is cool, thats right cool, Im old school. I like how the reflection looks part country road, and part glass and steel city scape. Like its saying let me take you.</td>', 'This is cool, thats right cool, Im old school. I like how the reflection looks part country road, and part glass and steel city scape. Like its saying let me take you.', '2007-12-16 10:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4316938, 621051, 68769, '<td valign="top">This is a good motion shot. For some reason it falls short of selling a car, possibility because a Porsche is so out of my price range, LOL.</td>', 'This is a good motion shot. For some reason it falls short of selling a car, possibility because a Porsche is so out of my price range, LOL.', '2007-12-16 10:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4316949, 620831, 68769, '<td valign="top">Well done, I am sold, How much are the payments..</td>', 'Well done, I am sold, How much are the payments..', '2007-12-16 10:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4316979, 621105, 60828, '<td valign="top">Love this shot</td>', 'Love this shot', '2007-12-16 11:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4316988, 620520, 68769, '<td valign="top">I think this would be a great pre-add, trying to garner interest before they are ready to show their hand.</td>', 'I think this would be a great pre-add, trying to garner interest before they are ready to show their hand.', '2007-12-16 11:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4316990, 620666, 68769, '<td valign="top">Nicely competed model.</td>', 'Nicely competed model.', '2007-12-16 11:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4317002, 620881, 68769, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot of a landscape with a car in it..</td>', 'This is a nice shot of a landscape with a car in it..', '2007-12-16 11:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4317008, 620945, 68769, '<td valign="top">I would buy that, oh yea I did, LOL, good shot.</td>', 'I would buy that, oh yea I did, LOL, good shot.', '2007-12-16 11:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4317022, 620837, 68769, '<td valign="top">Too much going on here that takes the eyes off  the cars, IMHO.</td>', 'Too much going on here that takes the eyes off  the cars, IMHO.', '2007-12-16 11:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4317029, 620123, 68769, '<td valign="top">NICE TRUCK!!! Is it for sale ?</td>', 'NICE TRUCK!!! Is it for sale ?', '2007-12-16 11:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4317036, 620041, 68769, '<td valign="top">So few cars have that grrrrr anymore, I see it here, nicely done.</td>', 'So few cars have that grrrrr anymore, I see it here, nicely done.', '2007-12-16 11:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4317045, 621047, 68769, '<td valign="top">I am seeing Rolls, but I''m not feeling Rolls, I think the reflection hurts a bit.</td>', 'I am seeing Rolls, but I''m not feeling Rolls, I think the reflection hurts a bit.', '2007-12-16 12:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4317057, 621002, 68769, '<td valign="top">Nice car and a great background, I see the effort. IMHO though I think a couple steps to the right might have helped show more of the side view, giving the perspective buyer more information in one picture.</td>', 'Nice car and a great background, I see the effort. IMHO though I think a couple steps to the right might have helped show more of the side view, giving the perspective buyer more information in one picture.', '2007-12-16 12:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4317064, 620989, 65234, '<td valign="top">Not buying anything that needs work; I have one nonfunctional car in my driveway already!  Think the shot could use a bit more contrast and sharpening to bring out the details.</td>', 'Not buying anything that needs work; I have one nonfunctional car in my driveway already!  Think the shot could use a bit more contrast and sharpening to bring out the details.', '2007-12-16 12:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4317066, 620838, 65234, '<td valign="top">Indeed.  Looks like the sort of car my husband wants for his midlife crisis.  He''s not getting one.  The light and architecture in the dealership show off the car nicely.  Still not getting one ;-)</td>', 'Indeed.  Looks like the sort of car my husband wants for his midlife crisis.  He''s not getting one.  The light and architecture in the dealership show off the car nicely.  Still not getting one ;-)', '2007-12-16 12:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4317069, 621087, 68769, '<td valign="top">You nailed it, you have the car, the reason you might want the car, I think its also ironic that you have shown a green car colored green. My first 10.</td>', 'You nailed it, you have the car, the reason you might want the car, I think its also ironic that you have shown a green car colored green. My first 10.', '2007-12-16 12:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4317070, 620677, 65234, '<td valign="top">Not the greatest shot technically (too much white space for my taste) but your subject is a hoot!  Extra point for humor.</td>', 'Not the greatest shot technically (too much white space for my taste) but your subject is a hoot!  Extra point for humor.', '2007-12-16 12:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4317073, 620202, 68769, '<td valign="top">This one is easy, I want the one in the middle, now how about that camera..</td>', 'This one is easy, I want the one in the middle, now how about that camera..', '2007-12-16 12:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4317075, 620704, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely car, and I like the angled composition.  I might prefer less DOF so the background is blurred out, and a bit faster shutter so the top of the roof isn''t so blindingly white.  Tough to expose for a dark car with bright sunlight, though.</td>', 'Lovely car, and I like the angled composition.  I might prefer less DOF so the background is blurred out, and a bit faster shutter so the top of the roof isn''t so blindingly white.  Tough to expose for a dark car with bright sunlight, though.', '2007-12-16 12:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4317079, 620925, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nicely angled composition, and the drop of water on his paws is a nice touch.  I think the cat could use a wee bit more room on the right to give him breathing room.</td>', 'Nicely angled composition, and the drop of water on his paws is a nice touch.  I think the cat could use a wee bit more room on the right to give him breathing room.', '2007-12-16 12:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4317081, 620946, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, and selective desat is good to minimize distractions in the background.  I''d like to see a little more detail on the car; I think there are stripes on the hood but I''m not sure.</td>', 'Interesting idea, and selective desat is good to minimize distractions in the background.  I''d like to see a little more detail on the car; I think there are stripes on the hood but I''m not sure.', '2007-12-16 12:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4317085, 620881, 65234, '<td valign="top">Stormy sky AND obligatory curvy road!  Nicely done.  Not sure I like the vignetting, but nice work overall.</td>', 'Stormy sky AND obligatory curvy road!  Nicely done.  Not sure I like the vignetting, but nice work overall.', '2007-12-16 12:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4317092, 620889, 65234, '<td valign="top">Ah, a suburban car :-)  Nice angle and sky.  I would clone out the distracting dark bits on the driveway, and maybe burn the lawns a little to give them more interest.</td>', 'Ah, a suburban car :-)  Nice angle and sky.  I would clone out the distracting dark bits on the driveway, and maybe burn the lawns a little to give them more interest.', '2007-12-16 12:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4317093, 621069, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice angle and great sky.  I do wish the rest of the car was in the shot.</td>', 'Nice angle and great sky.  I do wish the rest of the car was in the shot.', '2007-12-16 12:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4317097, 621054, 65234, '<td valign="top">Wow; nice find!  Reflections are distracting in color; maybe B&amp;W or sepia would work better?</td>', 'Wow; nice find!  Reflections are distracting in color; maybe B&W or sepia would work better?', '2007-12-16 12:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4317099, 621051, 65234, '<td valign="top">Oooh, with motion blur and everything!  Nice.  I can''t help but notice the white blob above the windshield; looks like a giant piece of popcorn.  Maybe clone that out?</td>', 'Oooh, with motion blur and everything!  Nice.  I can''t help but notice the white blob above the windshield; looks like a giant piece of popcorn.  Maybe clone that out?', '2007-12-16 12:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4317104, 621128, 65234, '<td valign="top">Think I''d appreciate this more in B&amp;W.  various reflections are making my eyes dart all over the place.</td>', 'Think I''d appreciate this more in B&W.  various reflections are making my eyes dart all over the place.', '2007-12-16 12:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4317107, 620917, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lighting works pretty well; composition is interesting and background doesn''t compete with the car.</td>', 'Lighting works pretty well; composition is interesting and background doesn''t compete with the car.', '2007-12-16 12:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4317111, 620520, 65234, '<td valign="top">Car bokeh!  Nice shot.</td>', 'Car bokeh!  Nice shot.', '2007-12-16 12:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4317119, 621105, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lighting is dramatic at the expense of seeing more detail, which is OK with the subject.  Might work better "off-road" so the tires don''t look so flat.</td>', 'Lighting is dramatic at the expense of seeing more detail, which is OK with the subject.  Might work better "off-road" so the tires don''t look so flat.', '2007-12-16 13:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4317123, 620568, 65234, '<td valign="top">I get the idea, but the processing doesn''t appeal to me.  Sorry.</td>', 'I get the idea, but the processing doesn''t appeal to me.  Sorry.', '2007-12-16 13:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4317125, 621048, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection.  Bit of a halo around the top of the car, but other than that it looks like it belongs in a magazine.</td>', 'Nice reflection.  Bit of a halo around the top of the car, but other than that it looks like it belongs in a magazine.', '2007-12-16 13:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4317127, 621087, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice context for this car!!  And it''s literally green.  I think it could use a bit less sharpness on everything but the car.  Overall, very nice.</td>', 'Nice context for this car!!  And it''s literally green.  I think it could use a bit less sharpness on everything but the car.  Overall, very nice.', '2007-12-16 13:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4317129, 620908, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2007-12-16 13:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4317131, 621067, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective.  I''d desaturate the yellow snow ;-p</td>', 'Nice perspective.  I''d desaturate the yellow snow ;-p', '2007-12-16 13:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4317132, 620921, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice mood to this.</td>', 'Nice mood to this.', '2007-12-16 13:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4317134, 620931, 65234, '<td valign="top">Fabulous leading lines, especially in the clouds.  Very nice.</td>', 'Fabulous leading lines, especially in the clouds.  Very nice.', '2007-12-16 13:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4317139, 620123, 65234, '<td valign="top">Composition is nice with the off-road location.  Sky is quite blown out; I would probably try to underexpose a little to avoid that.  Tough to fix in post-processing.  I would also like to see better color on the truck; I can''t tell if the stripe is white or gray, and the rest of the truck is more muted than I would expect to see in an ad.</td>', 'Composition is nice with the off-road location.  Sky is quite blown out; I would probably try to underexpose a little to avoid that.  Tough to fix in post-processing.  I would also like to see better color on the truck; I can''t tell if the stripe is white or gray, and the rest of the truck is more muted than I would expect to see in an ad.', '2007-12-16 13:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4317141, 620785, 65234, '<td valign="top">Not terribly realistic-looking.</td>', 'Not terribly realistic-looking.', '2007-12-16 13:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4317144, 620618, 65234, '<td valign="top">Backwards from the edge of the cliff!  Nice perspective to make your point.</td>', 'Backwards from the edge of the cliff!  Nice perspective to make your point.', '2007-12-16 13:22:09.000000', NULL, 1);
