(4317907, 621077, 30982, '<td valign="top">Classic, gorgeous, and really nice to put it in context.  Lovely work, my dear!  Edit to add I just read through the comments and put me down in the "I love the people there!" category.  Not the same shot without ''em.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-12-17 01:11:33.</i></td>', 'Classic, gorgeous, and really nice to put it in context.  Lovely work, my dear!  Edit to add I just read through the comments and put me down in the "I love the people there!" category.  Not the same shot without ''em.', '2007-12-17 01:09:00.000000', '2007-12-17 01:11:33.000000', 0),
