(4317920, 620868, 30982, '<td valign="top">You definitely had the best title of the challenge and the processing added distinctly to the "anonymous" and "getaway" aspects of it.  ''Grats on the brown!</td>', 'You definitely had the best title of the challenge and the processing added distinctly to the "anonymous" and "getaway" aspects of it.  ''Grats on the brown!', '2007-12-17 01:18:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4317926, 621047, 30982, '<td valign="top">After reading through your comments, I''ve gathered this is a Bentley.  :-)  (I have no clue - I drive a Ford Ranger..)  Also, I''ve gathered I''m the only one that likes the reflections.  I''m always fascinated with reflections - kind of a dual world thing, which to me works well with the whole "dreaming of" concept.  But as you well know, I''m weird!</td>', 'After reading through your comments, I''ve gathered this is a Bentley.  :-)  (I have no clue - I drive a Ford Ranger..)  Also, I''ve gathered I''m the only one that likes the reflections.  I''m always fascinated with reflections - kind of a dual world thing, which to me works well with the whole "dreaming of" concept.  But as you well know, I''m weird!', '2007-12-17 01:22:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4317931, 620921, 53814, '<td valign="top">I''m thinking the number of uncalibrated monitors was responsible for the low score on this excellent composition. This photo sells the ferrari to me. Well done.</td>', 'I''m thinking the number of uncalibrated monitors was responsible for the low score on this excellent composition. This photo sells the ferrari to me. Well done.', '2007-12-17 01:27:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4317942, 620921, 30982, '<td valign="top">I think it''s the hint of the car that works here, and works very well.  Nicely done!</td>', 'I think it''s the hint of the car that works here, and works very well.  Nicely done!', '2007-12-17 01:42:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4317943, 621077, 53814, '<td valign="top">The fact that the people have stopped to look at the car in the rain (one w/o umbrella) really adds a nice subliminal message to this. Without the people this is merely a great shot.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-12-17 01:44:34.</i></td>', 'The fact that the people have stopped to look at the car in the rain (one w/o umbrella) really adds a nice subliminal message to this. Without the people this is merely a great shot.', '2007-12-17 01:43:47.000000', '2007-12-17 01:44:34.000000', 0),
(4317953, 621027, 68035, '<td valign="top">Peter well you and I boh went for the car marque idea and got ''punished'' for it.  I have to say I like the way you got the emblem so sharp but got the bokeh/blurred effect in the background.  It worked for me.</td>', 'Peter well you and I boh went for the car marque idea and got ''punished'' for it.  I have to say I like the way you got the emblem so sharp but got the bokeh/blurred effect in the background.  It worked for me.', '2007-12-17 01:57:56.000000', NULL, 0),
