(4319865, 620677, 48963, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for your comments. They were all enlightening, including the negative ones. In retrospect I should''ve taken a more interesting photo of the vehicle. My thinking at the time was to make it look like an authentic ad, and that taking a more interesting photo just would''ve been incongruent. I had the idea to go to the airport and get some shots of people kissing in the car and use that in the ad. I think that would''ve done better, although I''m not sure it would''ve made that much of a difference.<br/> <br/>On the bright side, there''s nowhere to go but up (well there is last place) from here!</td>', 'Thanks everyone for your comments. They were all enlightening, including the negative ones. In retrospect I should''ve taken a more interesting photo of the vehicle. My thinking at the time was to make it look like an authentic ad, and that taking a more interesting photo just would''ve been incongruent. I had the idea to go to the airport and get some shots of people kissing in the car and use that in the ad. I think that would''ve done better, although I''m not sure it would''ve made that much of a difference. On the bright side, there''s nowhere to go but up (well there is last place) from here!', '2007-12-18 03:34:25.000000', NULL, 0),
