(4321579, 620868, 65035, '<td valign="top">I love this and the title is just funny. For some reason it brings to mind the Blues Brothers, I know not why. I can imagine a bumbling group of bumbling sited Mafia wannabes running towards those cars at any minute, scrambling for cash to pay the rental. I''m sure you could sell this idea to Hollywood.</td>', 'I love this and the title is just funny. For some reason it brings to mind the Blues Brothers, I know not why. I can imagine a bumbling group of bumbling sited Mafia wannabes running towards those cars at any minute, scrambling for cash to pay the rental. I''m sure you could sell this idea to Hollywood.', '2007-12-18 22:51:47.000000', NULL, 0),
