(4321610, 621047, 65035, '<td valign="top">I''m relieved that it''s a Bentley, it just didn''t seem right to me for a Rolls not to have a silver lady. I really like the reflections it gives it that unattainable feel. Maybe it''s just ''cos that''s how I usually see cars like this, with my nose up against the glass peering in at them.</td>', 'I''m relieved that it''s a Bentley, it just didn''t seem right to me for a Rolls not to have a silver lady. I really like the reflections it gives it that unattainable feel. Maybe it''s just ''cos that''s how I usually see cars like this, with my nose up against the glass peering in at them.', '2007-12-18 23:12:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4321611, 621010, 65035, '<td valign="top">I really like this, I drive on my own a lot at night on country roads so I''d buy that brave red car. I love the headlights shining on the road and the colours are awesome.</td>', 'I really like this, I drive on my own a lot at night on country roads so I''d buy that brave red car. I love the headlights shining on the road and the colours are awesome.', '2007-12-18 23:15:12.000000', NULL, 0),
