(4327333, 620881, 46870, '<td valign="top">Love it bro Heart stopper shot Hug:)<br/> Congratulations</td>', 'Love it bro Heart stopper shot Hug:) Congratulations', '2007-12-21 01:20:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4327533, 620861, 61679, '<td valign="top">Hello from the Critique Club:<br/> <br/>Since I couldnt vote in this challenge, this is the first time Ive had a chance to look at your image.  My first impression of this image was I wonder how he did that.  I think this image is very well done and there is nothing technically that I can suggest for improvement.  So if this image is so well done, why did it only score a 5.1?  I believe that the voters were expecting to see real cars in this challenge and your score suffered for using a toy.  I think your image is underrated and easily deserves to be a 6+ score in my opinion.  Keep shooting and good luck in future challenges.<br/> <br/>Feel free to PM me if you have any questions regarding this critique.<br/> <br/>Tim<br/></td>', 'Hello from the Critique Club: Since I couldnt vote in this challenge, this is the first time Ive had a chance to look at your image.  My first impression of this image was I wonder how he did that.  I think this image is very well done and there is nothing technically that I can suggest for improvement.  So if this image is so well done, why did it only score a 5.1?  I believe that the voters were expecting to see real cars in this challenge and your score suffered for using a toy.  I think your image is underrated and easily deserves to be a 6+ score in my opinion.  Keep shooting and good luck in future challenges. Feel free to PM me if you have any questions regarding this critique. Tim', '2007-12-21 06:48:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4327540, 620041, 61679, '<td valign="top">Hello from the Critique Club:<br/> <br/>Since I couldnt vote in this challenge, this is the first time Ive had a chance to look at your image.  My first impression of this image was Nice shot.  You went with the traditional low perspective/wide angle look used in car ads and it worked well in this image.  For me, the crop is a little tight in this image and from reading your notes, I understand why.  You received a lot of good comments during the challenge that point out the little things that kept this image from scoring in the 6s.  Since this wasnt your car, there wasnt much you could do with the car to give it that polished car ad feel.  Keep shooting and good luck in future challenges.<br/> <br/>Feel free to PM me if you have any questions regarding this critique.<br/> <br/>Tim<br/></td>', 'Hello from the Critique Club: Since I couldnt vote in this challenge, this is the first time Ive had a chance to look at your image.  My first impression of this image was Nice shot.  You went with the traditional low perspective/wide angle look used in car ads and it worked well in this image.  For me, the crop is a little tight in this image and from reading your notes, I understand why.  You received a lot of good comments during the challenge that point out the little things that kept this image from scoring in the 6s.  Since this wasnt your car, there wasnt much you could do with the car to give it that polished car ad feel.  Keep shooting and good luck in future challenges. Feel free to PM me if you have any questions regarding this critique. Tim', '2007-12-21 06:57:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4328038, 620931, 31637, '<td valign="top">Hello from CC. <br/> <br/>I voted this a 6, I thought it was very much a good image for an ad. The sky made for a good backdrop. Problem with most people would be that your car is the supporting actor in this scene. It''s overshadowed by the sky a little. <br/> <br/>The car itself is exposed perfectly, and the angle is very nice in the 3rd part of the frame. <br/> <br/>If you tried to keep your car as the main focal point with a little less sky and road, then maybe you would have made the top 3. If your going to include all the road, then the car should be in action.<br/> <br/>Good job though.</td>', 'Hello from CC.  I voted this a 6, I thought it was very much a good image for an ad. The sky made for a good backdrop. Problem with most people would be that your car is the supporting actor in this scene. It''s overshadowed by the sky a little.  The car itself is exposed perfectly, and the angle is very nice in the 3rd part of the frame.  If you tried to keep your car as the main focal point with a little less sky and road, then maybe you would have made the top 3. If your going to include all the road, then the car should be in action. Good job though.', '2007-12-21 11:48:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4329104, 620881, 63503, '<td valign="top">I wish I could take pictures like you man.</td>', 'I wish I could take pictures like you man.', '2007-12-21 19:18:11.000000', NULL, 0),
